  <para style="h">1 Abami</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca mbere c’Abami</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Abami</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ab</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca mbere</para>
  <para style="mt1">c’Abami</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Adoniya yiyimika nk’umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Umwami Dawidi amaze gukura akagera mu busaza, nta kintu cashobora kumumara imbeho, mbere naho bamupfuka uburengeti bwinshi ntiyashobora gususuruka. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Abasavyi biwe baravuga bati: “Reka tumuronderere inkumi yo kumusanga, imubungabunge, izoje iramuryama i ruhande kugira ngo isusurutse umwami wacu.”<verse eid="1KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Nuko barondera inkumi nziza muri Isirayeli, maze baronka Abishagi, Umunyashunemukazi, bamuzanira umwami. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Uwo mukobwa yari mwiza cane; afata neza umwami, aramubungabunga, ariko umwami ntiyigeze aryamana na we nk’umugore.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Muri ico gihe, Adoniya umuhungu Dawidi yavyaye ku mugore wiwe Hagiti atangura kwishira hejuru ati: “Ni jewe nzoba umwami.” Nuko yironderera imikogote n’amafarasi hamwe n’abasoda mirongo itanu bo kugendera imbere yiwe. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />(Se Dawidi ntiyari bwigere amukankamira ati: “Ivyo ugira ni ibiki?” Yari umuhungu mwiza cane yakurikira Abusalomu.)<verse eid="1KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya agisha inama Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya, hamwe na Abiyatari umuherezi, na bo baramushigikira. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Ariko Sadoki umuherezi, Benaya mwene Yehoyada, Natani umuvugishwa, Shimeyi na Reyi hamwe n’abasoda bagendanira Dawidi ntibifatanya na Adoniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adoniya ashikana ibimazi vy’intama, impene hamwe n’amashashi y’inka kw’Ibuye ry’i Zoheleti hafi ya Eni-Rogeli. Atumira abahungu bavukana ari bo bana b’umwami, ndetse n’abatware b’i Buyuda bose, <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />ariko ntiyatumira Natani umuvugishwa canke Benaya n’abasoda bagendanira umwami, canke mwenewabo Salomo.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Maze Natani abaza Batisheba nyina wa Salomo ati: “Mbega woba wumvise ko Adoniya umuhungu wa Hagiti, yiyimitse nk’umwami, umwami wacu Dawidi atabizi? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Reka rero ndakugire inama y’ukuntu worokora ubuzima bwawe n’ubw’umuhungu wawe Salomo. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Genda ku mwami Dawidi umubwire uti: ‘Mwami wanje, mbega ntiwandahiye uti: “Ni ukuri umuhungu wawe Salomo ni we azonsubirira yicare ku ntebe y’ubwami bwanje”? None ni kubera iki Adoniya ari we yabaye umwami?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Ukiriko uravugana n’umwami, nanje ndaza kwinjira nemeze ivyo uzoba uriko uravuga.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Nuko Batisheba aja kuraba umwami mu cumba ciwe, aho Abishagi Umunyashunemukazi yari amusangiye kuko yari ashaje cane. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Batisheba yikubita imbere yiwe, arapfukama. Umwami aramubaza ati: “Wipfuza iki?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Mwami wanje, ni wewe wasezeraniye umusavyi wawe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uti: ‘Umuhungu wawe Salomo ni we azoba umwami, ansubirire, ni we azokwicara ku ntebe yanje y’ubwami.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Ariko Adoniya ni we yabaye umwami, kandi na wewe mwami wanje nta vyo wamenye. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Yatanze ibimazi vy’inka nyinshi, amashashi avyibushe hamwe n’intama, atumira abahungu b’umwami bose, atumira Abiyatari umuherezi na Yowabu umugabisha w’ingabo, ariko ntiyatumira Salomo umusavyi wawe. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Mwami wanje, Isirayeli yose ihanze amaso wewe, kugira ngo imenye uwuzosubirira umwami wanje ku ntebe yiwe. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Nutagira ico ukoze ga mwami wanje, twe n’umuhungu wanje Salomo tuzofatwa nk’abanyakibi niwamara guhamvya ba sogokuruza.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Batisheba akiriko aravugana n’umwami, Natani umuvugishwa na we aba arashitse. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Babarira umwami bati: “Natani umuvugishwa ari ngaha.” Nuko ashikira umwami, yikubita imbere yiwe, aramwunamira.<verse eid="1KI 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Natani abaza umwami ati: “Mwami nyeningoma, wahisemwo ko Adoniya aba ari we agusubirira, akicara ku ntebe yawe y’ubwami? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Uwu musi yatanze ibimazi vyinshi vy’inka, amashashi avyibushe hamwe n’intama. Yatumiye abahungu b’umwami, umugabisha w’ingabo, hamwe na Abiyatari umuherezi. Ubu turiko turavugana bariko bararya banywa, bavuga bati: ‘Niharambe umwami Adoniya!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Ariko ga mwami wanje, twe na Sadoki umuherezi, na Benaya mwene Yehoyada hamwe n’umusavyi wawe Salomo, ntiyadutumiye. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />None ga nyaguhora ku ngoma, ivyo ni wewe wabikoze utamenyesheje abasavyi bawe uwuzogusubirira ku ntebe y’ubwami?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi yimika Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Umwami Dawidi arishura ati: “Nimumpamagarire Batisheba!” Nuko Batisheba arinjira ahagarara imbere y’umwami.<verse eid="1KI 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Umwami aca asubiramwo ya ndahiro ati: “Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwandokoye mu magorwa yose, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />ko Salomo umuhungu wawe ari we azonsubirira, akicara ku ntebe y’ubwami uhereye uwu musi nyene, nk’uko nari narabikurahiye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Nuko Batisheba aca yikubita imbere yiwe, arapfukama, avuga ati: “Niharambe umwami wanje Dawidi!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Dawidi aca avuga ati: “Nimumpamagarire Sadoki umuherezi, Natani umuvugishwa, na Benaya mwene Yehoyada.” Bashitse imbere y’umwami, arababwira ati: <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />“Fata Salomo n’abatware banje mumanuke kw’iriba ry’i Gihoni, Salomo agendere ku nyumbu yanje. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Sadoki umuherezi na Natani umuvugishwa baheze bamurobanuze amavuta nk’umwami wa Isirayeli. Muvuze inzamba, mwongere muvuge n’ijwi rirenga muti: ‘Niharambe umwami Salomo!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Muce mudugana na we, yicare ku ntebe y’ubwami. Ni we ngize umukuru wo muri Isirayeli n’i Buyuda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Benaya mwene Yehoyada yishura umwami ati: “Amen! Nibibe nk’uko ubivuze, mwami! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’umwami wanje, abishitse! <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabanye n’umwami wanje, azobane na Salomo, akomeze ingoma yiwe gusumvya n’iy’umwami wanje Dawidi!”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Nuko Sadoki umuherezi, Natani umuvugishwa, Benaya mwene Yehoyada, Abakereti hamwe n’Abapeleti baramanuka, bashira Salomo ku nyumbu y’umwami Dawidi, baramuherekeza bamujana i Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Sadoki umuherezi afata ihembe ry’amavuta ryari mw’Ihema, arobanura Salomo. Baca bavuza inzamba, bavuga n’ijwi rirenga bati: “Niharambe umwami Salomo!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Abantu bose baca badugana na we, bavuza imyironge, banezerewe cane, biha akamo, gushika n’aho isi inyiganyiga.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adoniya hamwe n’abo yari yatumiye bumva ako kamo bariko baraheraheza ibirori vyabo. Yowabu yumvise inzamba, arabaza ati: “Ivyo ni ibiki? Urwo rwamo rwose mu gisagara ni urw’iki?”<verse eid="1KI 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Ataranaheza kuvuga, Yonatani mwene Abiyatari umuherezi aba arashitse. Adoniya amubwira ati: “Injira, kuko umuntu mwiza nka wewe utegerezwa kuba uzanye inkuru nziza.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Yonatani na we amwishura ati: “Oya na mba! Umwami wacu Dawidi yimitse Salomo nk’umwami. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Umwami yamurungikanye Sadoki umuherezi, Natani umuvugishwa, Benaya mwene Yehoyada, Abakereti n’Abapeleti, bamushira ku nyumbu y’umwami, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Sadoki umuherezi na Natani umuvugishwa bamurobanuza amavuta nk’umwami i Gihoni. Baca bavayo baduga biha akamo bamushimagiza, igisagara na co kinezeranwa na bo. Urwo rwamo rwose mwumva ni ico ruvako. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Ikindi na co, Salomo yamaze kwicara ku ntebe y’ubwami. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Abatware b’i bwami bose bagiye gukeza umwami Dawidi bati: ‘Imana yawe ikomeze Salomo, izina ryiwe ribe rurangiranwa gusumba iryawe, n’ingoma yiwe ikomere gusumba iyawe!’ Umwami na we aho ari ku buriri aca arunama ashima Imana, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />avuga ati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli nahimbazwe, we yemereye amaso yanje kubona umusubirizi wanje uwu musi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Abari kumwe na Adoniya bumvise ivyo, baterwa n’ubwoba bwinshi, barashwiragira. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Ariko Adoniya, kubera gutinya Salomo, aca ariruka afata amahembe y’igicaniro. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Maze umuntu araza abwira Salomo ati: “Adoniya yatinye umwami Salomo, none yafashe amahembe y’igicaniro. Yavuze ati: ‘Umwami Salomo narahire ko aticisha inkota umusavyi wiwe uwu musi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Salomo yishura ati: “Nimba yemera ko agiye kwubaha umwami, nta n’agashatsi kamuvako. Ariko nihagira ikibi kimubonekako, arapfa nta kabuza.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Nuko umwami Salomo atuma abantu bamukura ku gicaniro. Adoniya araza yikubita imbere y’umwami Salomo, Salomo na we amubwira ati: “Niwitahire.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi yihanikiriza Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Dawidi yegereje gupfa, yihanikiririza umuhungu wiwe Salomo ati:<verse eid="1KI 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />“Ehe ngiye gufata inzira abo kw’isi bose bafata. Ushikame, ube umugabo. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Uze ushire umutima ku vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe yihanikiriza, ugendere mu nzira ziwe. Uze witondere amategeko n’amabwirizwa yiwe, ivyo yashinze n’ivyo yategetse nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vya Mose. Ivyo bizotuma ivyo ukora vyose bikugendera neza aho uzoja hose. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Niwabikora, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoshitsa ivyo yansezeraniye. Yambwiye ati: ‘Uruvyaro rwawe nirwigenza uko bibereye, rukankurikira mu bwizigirwa n’imitima yarwo yose n’imishaha yarwo yose, ntuzokwigera ubura uwo kugusubirira ku ngoma ya Isirayeli.’<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />Ubu rero urazi ivyo Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya yangiriye mu kwica abagabisha b’ingabo za Isirayeli babiri, Abuneri mwene Neri na Amasa mwene Yeteri. Yasheshe amaraso yabo mu gihe c’amahoro, nk’aho boba baguye ku rugamba, gutyo yandurisha umukanda wiwe n’ibirato vyiwe amaraso y’abantu ata co bazira. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Uzomukorere ico ubona ko kibereye, ariko ntuze umureke ngo yisazire, ngo amanukane imvi ziwe mu mva amahoro.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />Ariko uze ugirire neza bene Baruzilayi Umunyagileyadi, uzokwame ubatumira gusangira nawe ku meza ibihe vyose, bangiriye neza igihe nahunga mwenewanyu Abusalomu.<verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />Kandi uze wibuke Shimeyi mwene Gera Umubenyamini, w’i Bahurimu. Yamvumye imivumo myinshi igihe nariko ndahungira i Mahanayimu. Igihe yaza kuntegerera kuri Yorodani, namurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nti: ‘Sinzokuranduza inkota.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Ariko ubu ntumufate nk’aho ata kimwagira. Uri umugabo w’ubwenge, uzomenya ingene uzomugenza. Imvi ziwe azozimanukane i kuzimu ziriko amaraso.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Nuko Dawidi ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Dawidi yaganje Isirayeli imyaka mirongo ine: imyaka indwi yabaye i Heburoni, iyindi mirongo itatu n’itatu aba i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Maze Salomo yicara ku ntebe y’ubwami ya se Dawidi, ingoma yiwe irakomera.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salomo akomeza ingoma yiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Igihe kimwe Adoniya mwene Hagiti aja kuraba Batisheba nyina wa Salomo. Batisheba aramubaza ati: “Ugenzwa n’amahoro?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Na we ati: “Egome ngenzwa n’amahoro.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Arabandanya ati: “Ndafise ico ndakubwira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Batisheba ati: “Ndaguteze amatwi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Aravuga ati: “Urazi ko ingoma yari iyanje. Abisirayeli bose bashaka ko ndababera umwami. Ariko vyarahindutse, ubwami bwegukiye mwenewacu, kuko yabuhawe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />None rero mfise ico ndagusaba, kandi ndakwinginze ntunyankire.” Batisheba ati: “Wipfuza ko ndagukorera iki?”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Adoniya amwishura ati: “Mvugira ku mwami Salomo ndazi arakwumvira. Munsabire anyemerere ndongore Abishagi, umukobwa w’i Shunemu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batisheba aca amubwira ati: “Ndavyemeye, ndakuvugira ku mwami.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Batisheba agiye kuraba umwami Salomo ngo avugire Adoniya, umwami arahaguruka aja kumusanganira, aramwunamira, hanyuma yicara ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami. Amaze kwicara aca asaba ko bazana iyindi ntebe y’umugabekazi, Batisheba aca yicara i buryo bwiwe.<verse eid="1KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Batisheba abwira umwami ati: “Hari ico ngusaba kandi ndakwinginze ntunyankire.” Umwami ati: “Mbarira, urazi ko ntokwankira.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Amubwira ati: “Emerera mwenewanyu Adoniya arongore Abishagi, umukobwa w’i Shunemu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Umwami Salomo abaza nyina ati: “Ni kubera iki ushaka ko Abishagi Umunyashunemukazi arongorwa na Adoniya? Ahubwo musabire n’ubwami na bwo! Ntuzi ko ari mukurwanje, kandi akaba afise Abiyatari umuherezi na Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya ku ruhande rwiwe!”<verse eid="1KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Umwami Salomo aca ararahira mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobimpanire, ndetse birengeje, nintica Adoniya kubera ivyo ansavye. <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yanyemeje, anyicarika ku ntebe ya data Dawidi, anshiraho nk’uko yabisezeranye. None rero ndarahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko Adoniya aja gupfa uwu musi nyene!” <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Nuko umwami Salomo aca aha Benaya mwene Yehoyada itegeko ryo kumwica, Adoniya aca aricwa.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Umwami Salomo aca abarira Abiyatari umuherezi ati: “Subira i wanyu muri Anatoti. Wari ukwiye gupfa ariko sindakwica kuko wareruye Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji imbere ya data Dawidi, ukabana na we mu bihe bigoye vyose yaciyemwo.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Nuko Salomo akura Abiyatari mu gikorwa c’umuherezi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze aba ashikije ijambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavugiye i Shilo ku ruvyaro rwa Eli.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yowabu ntiyari yifatanije na Abusalomu mu bugarariji bwiwe, ariko yari yifatanije na Adoniya mu kugarariza kwiwe. Yumvise ko Adoniya yapfuye, aca arirukanga mw’Ihema ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, afata amahembe y’igicaniro. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Umwami Salomo aramenya ko Yowabu yahungiye mw’ihema ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi ko ari i ruhande y’igicaniro. Aca abarira Benaya mwene Yehoyada ati: “Genda umwice!”<verse eid="1KI 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Benaya aja mw’Ihema ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yowabu ati: “Umwami avuze ngo: ‘Sohoka!’ ” Ariko Yowabu yishura ati: “Eka sinsohoka, mpfira ngaha.” Benaya aca aragenda abarira umwami uko Yowabu yavuze.<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Umwami aca abarira Benaya ati: “Bikore uko abivuze. Genda umwice, umuhambe, twe n’inzu ya data udukureko umuvumo w’amaraso y’abantu ata co bazira Yowabu yasheshe. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azomwishura ibihwanye n’ubwicanyi yagiriye abantu babiri bamusumvya ubugororotsi kandi bamusumvya n’ubutwari. Data ntiyigeze amenya ivy’urupfu rwa Abuneri mwene Neri umugabisha w’ingabo za Isirayeli, hamwe n’urwa Amasa mwene Yeteri umugabisha w’ingabo za Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Umuvumo w’amaraso yabo uzoje kuri Yowabu n’uruvyaro rwiwe ibihe vyose. Ariko amahoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abe kuri Dawidi, ku ruvyaro rwiwe, ku nzu yiwe no ku ngoma yiwe ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Benaya mwene Yehoyada aca asubirayo yica Yowabu, amuhambisha mw’itongo ryiwe mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Umwami aca agira Benaya mwene Yehoyada umukuru w’ingabo, asubirira Yowabu. Abiyatari umuherezi na we asubirirwa na Sadoki umuherezi.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Umwami aca atumako Shimeyi amubwira ati: “Niwiyubakire inzu aha i Yerusalemu abe ari ho uba. Ariko ntuze wigere usohoka igisagara ngo hagire ahandi uja! <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Nihagira aho uja ukarengana umwonga wa Kidironi, nta kabuza uzopfa, kandi amaraso yawe azoguharurweko.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shimeyi yishura umwami ati: “Ivyo uvuze ni vyiza. Nzokora ivyo umwami wanje ambariye.” Nuko Shimeyi aba i Yerusalemu ahamara igihe kirekire.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Ariko haciye imyaka itatu, abagurano babiri ba Shimeyi bahungira kwa Akishi mwene Mayaka umwami w’i Gati. Shimeyi amenye ko ari yo bari, <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />aca ashira amatandiko ku ndogoba, aja i Gati kubarondera. Abatoye, aca arabagarukana i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="1KI 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Maze Salomo yumva ko Shimeyi yavuye i Yerusalemu akaja i Gati akagaruka. <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />Umwami aca atumako Shimeyi amubaza ati: “Sinari nakurahije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndakubwira ko nihagira ahantu na hamwe uja ata kabuza uzokwicwa, nawe ukishura uti: ‘Ivyo uvuze ni vyiza, nzokora ico umwami wanje ambariye’? <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />None ni kuki utubahirije indahiro warahiriye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntukurikize ivyo nagutegetse?”<verse eid="1KI 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Umwami arasubira amubwira ati: “Urazi mu mutima wawe ikibi wakoreye data Dawidi. None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhore ikibi wakoze. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Ariko hahezagirwe umwami Salomo, ingoma ya Dawidi ihore ihangamye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Umwami aca aha itegeko Benaya mwene Yehoyada, afata Shimeyi aja kumwica.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Kuva ico gihe ingoma ya Salomo ica irakomera.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Salomo asaba ubwenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Umwami Salomo agirirana isezerano na Farawo umwami wa Egiputa, arongora n’umukobwa wiwe. Amuzana kuba mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, gushika ahejeje kwubaka ikirimba ciwe, Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hamwe n’inzitiro zikikuje Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Ariko abantu bari bagishikanira ibimazi mu bibanza bitandukanye vyari vyaratoranijwe, kuko ata ngoro yari bwubakirwe Izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Salomo yarakunda <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, akagendera mu mategeko ya se Dawidi, kiretse ko we yatangiye ibimazi mu bindi bibanza vyatoranijwe, akahaturirira n’imibavu.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Umwami aja gutangira ibimazi i Gibeyoni, kuko ari ho hari hakuru kuruta ibindi bibanza vyose bitaramutse. Nuko Salomo aragenda ahatangira ibimazi vyo guturirwa igihumbi. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Akiri i Gibeyoni, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yiyereka Salomo mw’ijoro ari mu ndoto, aramubwira ati: “Nsaba ico ushaka cose ndakiguha.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Salomo arishura ati: “Wagiriye neza cane umusavyi wawe Dawidi ari we data, kuko yakubereye umwizigirwa, akakugororokera n’umutima utunganye. Kandi ukwo kugira neza waragukomeje, gushika aho umuha umuhungu wiwe yicara ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami uno musi.<verse eid="1KI 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />None rero, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yanje, jewe umusavyi wawe wangize umwami mu kibanza ca data Dawidi. Ariko ndi umwana muto, sinzi uko ndabigenza. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Jewe umusavyi wawe ndi hagati mu bantu watoranije, ihanga rinini cane ritoharurika. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />None rero mpa umutima w’ubwenge, kugira ngo nshobore kurongora ubwoko bwawe no gutandukanya iciza n’ikibi. Mbega none ni nde yoshobora kuganza ubu bwoko bwawe bwinshi bungana gutya?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Imana inezerezwa cane n’uko Salomo ayisavye ikintu nk’ico, <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />maze imubwira iti: “Ko unsavye ivyo, utansavye kuramba canke ubutunzi, canke ngo unsabe kumara abansi bawe, ahubwo ukansaba ubwenge bwo kurongorana ubugorororotsi, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />nzoguha ivyo unsavye. Nzoguha ubwenge n’umutima w’ubumenyi, ivyo ata wundi muntu n’umwe yigeze aronka imbere yawe, kandi ata n’uwundi azokwigera aronka inyuma yawe. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Hejuru y’ivyo, nzoguha n’ivyo utansavye: ubutunzi n’icubahiro, kugira ngo mu misi y’ukubaho kwawe ntihaze higere haboneka uwundi mwami azongana nawe. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Kandi niwagendera mu nzira zanje, ukubaha amategeko yanje nk’uko so Dawidi yabigize, nzogwiza imyaka yo kubaho kwawe.” <verse eid="1KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Salomo yikanguye, atahura ko yariko ararota. Aca asubira i Yerusalemu, ahagarara imbere y’Isandugu y’Isezerano y’Imana, ashikana ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’ivy’ishimwe. Hanyuma akoranya abatware biwe abagirira umusi mukuru.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salomo aca urubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Igihe kimwe abamaraya babiri baza imbere y’umwami bahagararaho. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Umwe muri bo avuga ati: “Mwami wanje, twe n’uwu mugore tuba mu nzu imwe. Igihe navyara umwana twari kumwe muri iyo nzu. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Haciye imisi itatu, na we avyara umwana. Twari twenyene, nta wundi yari ahari atari twebwe.<verse eid="1KI 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Ariko ijoro rimwe umwana wiwe arapfa kuko yamuryamyeko. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Aca aravyuka mw’ijoro, atwara umwana wanje nsinziriye. Amushira kw’ibere ryiwe, azana uwo rwiwe yapfuye amushira kw’ibere ryanje. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Bukeye, mvyutse ngo nonse umwana wanje, nsanga yapfuye. Ariko ndamwihweje neza mu gatondo habona, nsanga si wa mwana jewe nivyariye.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Wa mugore wundi na we ati: “Uwo muzima ni we rwanje, uwo yapfuye ni we rwawe.” Umwe wa mbere arashishikara ati: “Haba na mba! Uwo yapfuye ni we rwawe, uwo muzima ni we ari uwanje.” Nuko babandanya guharirira imbere y’umwami.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Umwami aca avuga ati: “Umwe avuga ngo: ‘Umwana wanje ni uwu akomeye, uwawe ni uwu yapfuye,’ uwundi na we ati: ‘Urabesha, umwana wanje ni uwu ari muzima.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Umwami aca abandanya avuga ati: “Nimunzanira inkota.” Nuko barayimuzanira. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Aca atanga itegeko ati: “Fata uwo mwana muzima mumucemwo ibihimba bibiri, kimwe mugihe umwe, ikindi mugihe uwundi.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Nyina w’uwo mwana muzima yumva ikibabarwe c’umwana wiwe, kuko yamukunda cane, aca arasemerera ati: “Ndakwinginze mwami wanje, muhe uwo mwana amutware, ntumwice!” Ariko uwundi ati: “Nta n’umwe muri twebwe amutwara. Nibamucemwo kubiri!”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Umwami aca avuga ati: “Uwo mwana muzima nimumuhe uwo mugore wa mbere. Ntimumwice; ni we nyina wiwe.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Abisirayeli bose bumvise urubanza rwaciwe n’umwami, baramutangarira cane, kuko babonye ko afise ubwenge bwo guca imanza buva ku Mana.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abatware bafasha Salomo gutwara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Nuko umwami Salomo aganza muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="1KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Aba ni bo bari abatware biwe:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:2">Azariya mwene Sadoki umuherezi,<verse eid="1KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Elihorefu na Ahiya, bene Shisha, bari abanyamabanga,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:3">Yehoshafati mwene Ahiludi yari umwanditsi.<verse eid="1KI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya mwene Yehoyada yari umugabisha w’ingabo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:4">Sadoki na Abiyatari bari abaherezi.<verse eid="1KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Azariya mwene Natani yari arongoye abakuru b’intara,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:5">Zabudi mwene Natani umuherezi yari umujenama w’umwami.<verse eid="1KI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishari yari ajejwe ikirimba,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:6">Adoniramu mwene Abuda na we yari ajejwe gukurikirana abahawe ibikorwa biruhisha.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Salomo yari afise kandi abatware cumi na babiri batwara intara cumi na zibiri za Isirayeli, ari na bo batanga ibikenewe i bwami. Umwe wese yari ajejwe gutanga ibikenewe vyose i bwami mu kwezi kumwe mu mwaka.<verse eid="1KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Abo na bo bari aba bakurikira:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:8">Beni-Huri yatwara intara y’imitumba ya Efurayimu.<verse eid="1KI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Beni-Dekeri yatwara Makazi, Shayalubimu, Beti-Shemeshi na Eloni-Beti-Hanani.<verse eid="1KI 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Beni-Hasedi yatwara Aruboti (Soko na Heferi hose hari iwe).<verse eid="1KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Beni-Abinadabu yatwara Nefoti Dori (yarongoye Tafati umukobwa wa Salomo).<verse eid="1KI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Bayana mwene Ahiludi yatwara Tanaki na Megido, na Beti-Shani yose hafi ya Zaretani musi ya Yezireyeli. Hava i Beti-Shani hagashika muri Abeli-Mehola, hakurya ya Yokimeyamu.<verse eid="1KI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Beni-Geberi yatwara Ramoti Gileyadi harimwo igisagara ca Yayiro mwene Manase i Gileyadi, hamwe na Arugobu ho muri Bashani, hakabamwo n’ibisagara mirongo itandatu bininibinini bizitiye, bikagira ivyugazo vy’imyakaka ku marembo yavyo.<verse eid="1KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabu mwene Ido yatwara Mahanayimu.<verse eid="1KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimazi yatwara intara ya Nafutali. Uwo yari yarongoye Basemati, umukobwa wa Salomo.<verse eid="1KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Bayana mwene Hushayi yatwara intara ya Asheri no muri Bayaloti.<verse eid="1KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehoshafati mwene Paruwa yatwara intara ya Isakari,<verse eid="1KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimeyi mwene Ela yatwara intara ya Benyamini.<verse eid="1KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Geberi mwene Uri yatwara Gileyadi (Hahoze ari igihugu catwarwa na Sihoni umwami w’Abamori, hamwe n’igihugu catwarwa na Ogi umwami w’i Bashani). Ni we yari umutware w’iyo ntara wenyene.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyashikanirwa Salomo ku musi ku musi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Abantu bose b’i Buyuda na Isirayeli bangana n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga, kandi bararya, baranywa, bakibera mu munezero. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Maze Salomo aganza ubwami bwose, kuva ku ruzi Efurate gushika ku ntara y’Abafilisitiya no ku rubibe rwa Egiputa. Ivyo bihugu vyose vyamushikaniye amashikanwa yo kumusaba impore ibihe vyose yabayeho.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Ivyo Salomo yari akeneye ku musi ku musi kugira ngo agaburire abo ku kirimba zari ingero koru mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 5,5.</char></note> z’ifu isanzwe, ingero koru mirongo itandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 11.</char></note> z’ifu iseye neza, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />inka icumi zivyibushe zororewe mu ruhongore, inka mirongo ibiri zirisha ku musozi, intama ijana, udashizemwo impongo, ingeregere, ifumberi n’inkoko zivyibushe. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Salomo yatwara ubwami bwose bwo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, kuva i Tifusa gushika i Gaza, kandi ku mpande zose hari amahoro n’umutekano. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Mu bihe vyose Salomo yamaze, i Buyuda no muri Isirayeli hari amahoro n’umutekano, kuva mu ntara ya Dani mu buraruko ugashika mu ya Berisheba mu bumanuko, umuryango wose waba mu mizabibu no mu nsukoni zawo.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Salomo yari afise impongore ibihumbi bine z’ifarasi zakwega imikogote, akagira n’ifarasi ibihumbi cumi na bibiri.<verse eid="1KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Ku kwezi ku kwezi, abatwara intara, bama bazana ivyo umwami Salomo yaba akeneye, we ubwiwe hamwe n’abaja ku meza yiwe bose. Bama bitwararika kuraba ko ata kintu na kimwe kibuze. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Mbere barazana n’ingano zose zikenewe, hamwe rero n’ubwatsi bw’amafarasi akwega imikogote hamwe n’ayandi mafarasi ari mu mpongore.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwenge bwa Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Imana iha Salomo ubwenge bwinshi n’ugutahura bitagira urugero, bingana no kw’isesero ry’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Ubwenge bwa Salomo bwasumba ubw’abandi bantu bose bo mu buseruko, ndetse n’ubw’Abanyegiputa bose. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Yari umunyabwenge gusumvya abantu bose, harimwo na Etani Umuzirahi. Yarasumvya na Hemani, Karukoli na Daruda bene Maholi, kandi agira ukumenyekana cane mu mahanga yari amukikuje. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Yaciye imigani ibihumbi bitatu, yandika n’indirimbo igihumbi na zitanu. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Yarasigura ivy’ibiti vyose ahereye kw’isederi ry’i Libani, agashitsa no kuri ezobu yimeza ku mpome z’amazu. Yarasigura kandi n’ivy’ibikoko n’ibiguruka, ibikwega inda hasi n’amafi. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Abantu bo mu mahanga yose baraza aho Salomo ari kugira ngo bumvirize ivy’ubwenge bwiwe, barungitswe n’abami bo kw’isi yose bumvise ivy’ubwenge bwiwe.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Integuro zo kwubaka Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Hiramu umwami w’i Tiro yumvise ko Salomo yimitswe ngo asubirire se Dawidi, amurungikira intumwa zo kumukeza, kuko yamye akundana na Dawidi. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Salomo na we arungikira ubutumwa Hiramu, buvuga buti:<verse eid="1KI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Urazi ko kubera intambara data Dawidi yamye agwana hirya no hino, atigeze ashobora kwubakira Ingoro izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe, gushika <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashize abansi biwe musi y’ibirenge vyiwe. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Ariko ubu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje yampaye kuruhuka intambara ku mpande zose, nta mwansi nsigaranye, canke icago na kimwe. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />None rero nagomba kwubakira Ingoro Izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabibwiye data Dawidi aho yavuga ati: ‘Umuhungu wawe nzogusubiriza ku ngoma ni we azokwubakira Ingoro izina ryanje.’<verse eid="1KI 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Nagomba rero ko wotanga itegeko kugira ngo bancire amasederi y’i Libani. Abantu bawe bazokorane n’abanje, kandi abantu bawe nzobahemba impembo yose wombwira. Urazi ko ata bandi bantu na bamwe bafise ubuhinga bwo kubaza ibiti nk’ubw’Abanyesidoni.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Hiramu aronse ubutumwa bwa Salomo, aranezerwa cane avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nashimwe kuko uwu musi yahaye Dawidi umuhungu w’ubwenge ngo abe umwami w’ihanga rikomeye rya Isirayeli.”<verse eid="1KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Hiramu yishura Salomo ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 5:8">“Ubutumwa bwawe bwanshikiriye, kandi nzokora ivyo unsavye vyose, ndaguhe amasederi n’ubujwari ukeneye. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Abakozi banje bazobikura mu mitumba ya Libani babishikane ku kiyaga Mediterane, babitekere hamwe mu migwi, bimanuke vyoga gushika ku kibanza uzogena, hanyuma babitekurure kugira ngo ushobore kuvyikorera ubitware. Nawe uzoheza unyishure mu kumpa imfungurwa z’abantu bo ku kirimba canje.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Nuko Hiramu aha Salomo ibiti vy’amasederi n’ubujwari yari akeneye vyose. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Salomo na we aca arungikira Hiramu ingero koru ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 3.600.</char></note> z’ingano zo gutunga abo mu rugo rwiwe, n’ingero batu ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 440.000.</char></note> z’amavuta meza cane ya Elayo. Uko ni ko Salomo yama abikorera Hiramu ku mwaka ku mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha ubwenge Salomo, nk’uko yari yarabimusezeraniye. Hiramu na Salomo bagiriranira imigenderanire myiza, bagiranira n’amasezerano y’amahoro.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Umwami Salomo aca arondera abakozi ibihumbi mirongo itatu mu basanzwe baca ingero mu Bisirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Nuko arabarungika i Libani, bagenda barakuranwa ari ibihumbi cumicumi ku kwezi kugira ngo umuntu amare ukwezi kumwe i Libani, ayandi abiri na yo ayamare i muhira. Adoniramu ni we yari ajejwe abo bakozi. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Salomo yari afise abakozi ibihumbi mirongo indwi b’abikorezi, hamwe n’abandi ibihumbi mirongo umunani babaza amabuye ku misozi, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />hamwe n’abandi ibihumbi bitatu n’amajana atatu bakoresha abandi, bagacungera ingene ibikorwa biriko biragenda. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Nuko Umwami ategeka ko bimba amabuye maninimanini ameze neza, ngo bayabaze kugira ngo abe umushinge bazodugirizako mu kwubaka iyo Ngoro. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Abahinga b’abubatsi ba Salomo n’aba Hiramu bategura imbaho n’amabuye yo kwubaka Ingoro, bafadikanije n’abo mu gisagara ca Gebali.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Salomo yubaka Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Mu mwaka ugira amajana ane na mirongo umunani Abisirayeli bavuye muri Egiputa, mu mwaka ugira kane Salomo agiye ku ngoma muri Isirayeli, mu kwezi kwa kabiri ari kwo kwitwa Zivu, Salomo atangura kwubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Ingoro.<verse eid="1KI 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Ingoro umwami Salomo yubakiye Uhoraho yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itandatu z’uburebure, ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri z’ubwaguke, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itatu z’igihagararo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ukuvuga ko ari nk’imetero 27 z’uburebure, imetero 9 z’ubwaguke, n’imetero 14 z’igihagararo.</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Ibaraza ry’amaja imbere ry’inyubakwa nkuru y’Ingoro ryari rifise uburebure bungana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 4,5.</char></note> n’ubwaguke bungana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9.</char></note>, co kimwe n’inyubakwa nkuru y’Ingoro. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Ku mpome z’iyo Ngoro Salomo yashizeko amadirisha matomato ariko ivyuma. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Ku mpande zayo na ho bahubatse utwumba tugerekeranye, tuyikikuje yose uhereye Ahera cane. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Utwumba two hasi twari dufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, utwo hagati na two twari dufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,7.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, utwo hejuru na two twari dufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko indwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,2.</char></note>. Baza barasigaza aho imbaho zishikira ku ruhome, kugira ngo ntizinjizwe mu ruhome rw’imbere mu Ngoro.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Amabuye yo kwubaka iyo Ngoro bayabazira iyo bayimvye. Nta nyundo, incabiti canke ikindi cuma na kimwe cumvikana mu gihe co kuyubaka.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Ubwinjiriro bw’utwumba two hasi bwari ku ruhande rwo hepfo, hakaba n’ingazi zidugana ku twumba two hagati, hakaba n’iyava ku two hagati iduga ku two hejuru. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Ahejeje kwubaka iyo Ngoro, ayiha igisenge kigizwe n’inkingi hamwe n’imbaho vy’amasederi. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Yubaka n’utwumba dukikuje iyo Ngoro. Kamwekamwe kose kari gafise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note> z’amaduga, kagafatanywa n’ingoro hakoreshejwe inkingi z’amasederi.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Salomo, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />riti: “Ku bw’iyi Ngoro wubatse, niwakurikiza ivyo nashinze ugashitsa amabwirizwa yanje, ukitondera ivyo nihanikiririje, hanyuma ugakurikiza ivyagezwe vyanje, nanje nzoshitsa ivyo nasezeraniye so Dawidi. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Nzobana n’Abisirayeli, kandi sinzokwigera mpeba ubwoko bwanje bwa Isirayeli.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Nuko Salomo yubaka iyo Ngoro arayiheraheza neza. <verse eid="1KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Impome zose z’imbere azomekako imbaho z’amasederi, uhereye hasi ugashitsa ku gisenge, hasi na ho ahasasa imbaho z’akajwari. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Ayiha icumba c’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9.</char></note> z’uburebure, na co nyene acomekamwo imbaho z’amasederi, uhereye hasi ugashitsa ku gisenge; maze ico cumba kirategurwa kugira ngo kibe Ahera Cane h’iyo Ngoro. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Ahasigaye h’iyo Ngoro ari co cumba c’imbere y’Ahera cane hari hafise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 18.</char></note> uhereye ku cumba c’Ahera cane. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Impome zaho zari zometseko imbaho z’amasederi zishushanijeko uturende hamwe n’udushurwe dusambuye. Ahantu hose hari hapfutswe n’imbaho, nta buye ryaboneka.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Salomo ategura icumba c’imbere mu Ngoro aho gutereka Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Ico cumba carangana impande zose: cari gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amakika, ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri z’ubwaguke, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri z’uburebure bw’amaduga. Acomekamwo inzahabu ihinguwe neza, igicaniro na co acomekako imbaho z’amasederi. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Ahasigaye hose ho muri iyo ngoro ahomekako inzahabu ihinguwe neza, atambika n’iminyororo y’inzahabu ku bwinjiriro bw’Ahera cane. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Nuko imbere mu Ngoro hose ahomeka inzahabu, ayomeka no ku gicaniro c’Ahera cane.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Mu cumba co haruguru ashirayo abakerubi babiri babajwe mu giti c’umwelayo. Umwe wese yari afise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 4,5.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amaduga. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Ibaba rimwerimwe ry’umukerubi ryari rifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note> z’amakika; kuva kw’isunwa rimwe ry’ibaba ugashika ku ry’irindi hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 4,5.</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Umukerubi wa kabiri na we nyene yari afise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icumi. Abo bakerubi barangana kandi bagasa hose. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Uburebure bw’amaduga bwabo bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icumi. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Ashira abo bakerubi Ahera Cane, amababa yabo aramvuye, iry’umwe rikora ku ruhome rumwe rw’ico cumba, irindi rikora ku rundi, ayandi na yo agahurira hagati na hagati y’ico cumba. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Abo bakerubi na bo nyene abomekako inzahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Ku mpome zose, iz’icumba c’imbere n’iz’icumba c’amaja hanze ahakorogoshoramwo udushushanyo tw’abakerubi, ibigazi n’amashurwe asambuye. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Hasi muri ivyo vyumba bibiri na ho nyene ahomeka inzahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Mu bwinjiriro buja mu cumba c’imbere yahashize imiryango ibajwe mu biti vy’imyelayo vyo mw’ishamba kandi ibishimaryango n’umwaro wavyo mu bwaguke vyangana n’ica gatanu c’uruhome rwose. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Kuri izo mbaho zibiri z’imyelayo akorogoshoramwo uduhushanyo tw’abakerubi, ibigazi n’amashurwe asambuye, abo bakerubi n’ibigazi aca avyomekako inzahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Yongera akora n’umuryango mu mbaho z’imyelayo wo kwugara ku bwinjiriro bw’Ingoro. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Akora n’inzugi zibiri mu bujwari, zihurira hagati, rumwe barwuguruye rukaja i bubamfu urundi rukaja i buryo. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Aca akorogoshora kuri izo nzugi udushushanyo tw’abakerubi, ibigazi hamwe n’amashurwe asambuye, yongera azomekako inzahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Urugo rw’iyo nyubakwa rwari rwubatswe n’imirongo itatu y’amabuye maninimanini, hamwe n’umurongo umwe w’ibiti vy’amasederi bibajwe.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Umushinge w’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wubatswe mu mwaka ugira kane, mu kwezi kwa Zivu. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi na kabiri, mu kwezi kwawo kwa Buli ari kwo kw’umunani, iyo Ngoro yari ihejeje kwubakwa neza, isozerewe nk’uko vyari vyarategekanijwe. Yubatswe mu myaka indwi.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Salomo yubaka ikirimba ciwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Maze Salomo yubaka ikirimba ciwe, amara imyaka cumi n’itatu kugira ngo agiheze. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Imwe mu nyubakwa yubatse yitwa Ikirimba citiriwe Ishamba rya Libani. Yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana z’uburebure, mirongo itanu z’ubwaguke, na mirongo itatu z’igihagararo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 45 z’uburebure, 23 z’ubwaguke na 14 z’igihagararo.</char></note>. Yari ifise imirongo ine y’inkingi z’amasederi zitambitseko imyaro y’amasederi nyene. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Igisenge cari gikozwe mu biti vy’amasederi nyene bitambitswe kuri ya myaro uko yari cumicumi n’itanu mu murogo umwe wose. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Uruhome rumwerumwe rwose rwaba rufise imirongo itatu y’amadirisha, <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Inzugi n’amadirisha vyayo vyose vyari bifise uburebure n’ubwaguke bingana, vyari bitatubitatu birabana.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Yubaka n’ibaraza rifise inkingi, uburebure bwaryo bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu, ubwaguke na bwo bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23 z’uburebure n’imetero 14 z’ubwaguke.</char></note>, kandi imbere yaryo ahubaka akandi kabaraza kari gapfutswe n’igisenge gifashwe n’inkingi.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Yubaka n’ikindi cumba kinini kirimwo intebe y’ubwami, ari co cumba c’ubucamanza. Ni ho Salomo yicara aca imanza, hari hometsweko imbaho z’amasederi kuva hasi gushika hejuru. <verse eid="1KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Ingoro nyezina yabamwo yari inyuma y’aho, hose hari hubatswe co kimwe. Yongera yubakira ingoro nk’iyo nyene umukobwa wa Farawo yarongoye.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Izo nyubakwa zose, kuva hasi gushika hejuru zari zubatswe n’amabuye maninimanini, y’agaciro, afise impande ziringanirije ku mfuruka, abajwe n’umusumeno ku mpande zose hanyuma agasenwa. Bayubakisha kuva ku mushinge gushika aho bayimanikira, no kuva ku nzu y’imbere ugashitsa ku y’inyuma. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Umushinge wari ugizwe n’amabuye maninimanini kandi mezameza. Amwe muri ayo yaba afise nk’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 4,5.</char></note> canke umunani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,6.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amakika. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Hejuru y’ayo hajako amabuye yatoranijwe mezameza, abaje neza, hamwe n’ibiti vy’amasederi bibaje. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Ikirimba cari gikikujwe n’urugo rugizwe n’imirongo itatu y’amabuye, agakurikirwa n’umurongo umwe w’ibiti vy’amasederi bibaje, bimera nk’uko babigenjeje ku rugo rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’urubaraza rwayo.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyashizwe muri iyo Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Umwami Salomo atumako umuntu w’i Tiro yitwa Hiramu, <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />yari umuntu azi ubuhinga bwinshi bwo gucura ibintu mu mwakaka. Nyina wiwe yari Umwisirayeli wo mu muryango wa Nafutali, se na we yari Umunyetiro w’umuhinga mu bijanye no gukora ibintu mu mwakaka. Nuko araza akorera umwami Salomo ibikorwa amuhaye.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Hiramu acura inkingi zibiri mu mwakaka, z’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi n’umunani z’uburebure bw’igihagararo, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi na zibiri z’inkikuro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 8,1 z’uburebure bw’igihagararo n’imetero nka 5,4 z’inkikuro.</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Ashongesha umwakaka awukoramwo imifuniko ibiri yo gushira ku mitwe y’izo nkingi. Umwe wose wari ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero2,3.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’igihagararo. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Akora n’utundi dusharizo mu mwakaka, tumeze nk’urusobangane rw’insenga, two gushariza iyo mifuniko; umufuniko wose awushirako utwo dusharizo indwi tumeze nk’insenga. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Acura n’ibisharizo bimeze nk’amakomamanga, abimanika kuri bimwe bimeze nk’insenga, agira imirongo ibiri yavyo ikikuza za nkingi, agira gutyo nyene no ku myashi. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Imifuniko yo ku nkingi zo mw’ibaraza yari ikozwe mw’ishusho y’amashurwe y’amarebe, ikagira uburebure bw’igihagararo bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,8.</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Hejuru kuri iyo mifuniko, aho ihurira n’inkingi, ahashira ya makomamanga amajana abiri, iri ku mirongo, iyikikuje. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Ahagarika za nkingi mw’ibaraza ry’Ingoro; inkingi y’amaja mu bumanuko ayita Yakini, iy’amaja mu buraruko, ayita Bowazi. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Ku mitwe ya ya mifuniko hari hashushanijeko amashurwe y’amarebe.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Yongera akoresha ibesani nini ayita ikiyaga, bayikora ari umuzingi mu butare bw’umwakaka. Ubwaguke bwayo ku rubiga, uva ku ruhande rumwe uja ku rundi uciye hagati, bwangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 45.</char></note>, kandi yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23.</char></note> z’igihagararo. Uburebure bw’uwo muzingi na wo uwuzungurutse bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 14.</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Musi y’urubiga, hari ibisharizo vy’ibibumbano biyikikuje bishushanije nk’udukunga. Vyakikuza urubiga ari cumicumi ku ngero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 45.</char></note>, bikaba bitondetse ku mirongo ibiri ibangabanganye. Ivyo bisharizo vyari vyabumbanywe n’iyo besani.<verse eid="1KI 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Iyo besani yari ihagaze ku bibumbano vy’impfizi cumi na zibiri zicuzwe mu butare bw’umwakaka, zitatu zikaraba mu buraruko, zitatu mu burengero, izindi zitatu mu bumanuko hamwe n’izindi zitatu zaraba mu buseruko. Iyo besani bita ikiyaga, yari iteretse hejuru kuri ivyo bibumbano vy’izo mpfizi, maze ibice vy’inyuma vyazo bikaraba hagati musi y’ico kiyaga. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Cari gifise intimbatimba ingana n’ikiganza c’umuntu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 7,5.</char></note> kandi urubiga rwaco rwari rumeze nk’urw’igikombe, nk’ishurwe ry’ikirungu risambuye. Cashobora kwuzuzwa n’ingero batu ibihumbi bibiri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 44.000.</char></note><verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Acura n’ibitereko cumi mu mwakaka; kimwekimwe cose cari gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,8.</char></note> z’uburebure, ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine z’ubwaguke hamwe n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,4.</char></note> z’igihagararo. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Ivyo bitereko vyari bicuzwe gutya: vyari bifise imiringa ibase ifashe ku mbiga. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Kuri iyo miringa hari hashushanijweko intare, amashuri hamwe n’abakerubi, kandi kuri izo mbiga musi no hejuru y’ivyo bishushanijeko, hari hacuriyeko utugenegene twenena. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Igitereko cose cari gifise amapine ane acuzwe mu mwakaka, kandi ivyuma bifashe ayo mapine na vyo nyene vyari bicuzwe mu mwakaka: Mu mfuruka zaco uko ari zine hariho ibishigikizo vyo gushigikira ibesani, na vyo bikaba vyari bicuzwe mu mwakaka, uruhande rwose rusharijwe n’utugenegene dusobanganije. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Igitereko kimwekimwe cose cari gifise amapine ane acuzwe mu mwakaka hamwe n’ibiyafatanya, kikagira n’imbiga y’ubwaguke bw’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 45.</char></note>, n’ibiyishigikiye bipima ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe n’igice<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 68.</char></note> y’uburebure. Hariho ikimeze nk’umubehe gitoya gifashwe na ya mbiga. Vya bishigikizo na ya mbiga vyari bisharijwe n’utugenegene tw’amashurwe tubikorogoshoweko. Impande zine z’igitereko zari ziringaniye, <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />ya mapine n’ibiyafatanije bikaba musi yaco. Amapine yapima ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe n’igice<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 68.</char></note> y’uburebure, <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />afatanijwe nk’ay’umukogote. Ivyuma vyose bifatanye n’ayo mapine vyari bicuzwe mu mwakaka.<verse eid="1KI 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Igitereko cose cari gicuranywe n’ivyo gufata mu kugiterura, biri ku mfuruka zose. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Hejuru ku gitereko hariko ikimeze nk’ingata; uburebure bw’igihagararo bwaco bwari igice c’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 23.</char></note>. Ibishigikizo hamwe n’utuntu tubase two kuri co vyari bicuranywe na co. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Kuri ivyo bishigikizo, ku mpande zavyo zibase, no kuri twa tuntu tubase nyene yahakorogoshoyemwo udushushanyo tw’abakerubi, intare hamwe n’ibigazi, uko hagenda haringaniye, hamwe n’udushushanyo tw’amashurwe asobanganije ku mpande ziringaniye zose. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Uko ni ko yacuze ivyo bitereko cumi. Vyacuriwe mw’iforoma imwe, kandi vyose vyarasa bikongera bikangana.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Yongera acura amabesani cumi mu mwakaka, imwimwe yose yuzuzwa n’ingero batu mirongo ine,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 880.</char></note> kandi imwimwe yose yari ifise ubwaguke bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Ibitereko bitanu abitereka ku ruhande rw’i buryo rw’Ingoro, ibindi bitanu abishira ku ruhande rw’i bubamfu, ya besani nini yitwa Ikiyaga, ayishira ku ruhande rwo hepfo, ku mfuruka iherereye mu buseruko. <verse eid="1KI 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Huramu yarakoze kandi inkono, ivyaruzo, hamwe n’ibikombe vyo gusuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:40">Maze Huramu aheraheza ico gikorwa c’umwami Salomo yari yatanguye mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>:<verse eid="1KI 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />za nkingi zibiri;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">ya myashi ibiri imeze nk’ibikombe yo ku mutwe w’izo nkingi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">ya migufu ibiri isobekeranye yo gushariza iyo myashi ibumbwe bwa bikombe biri ku mitwe y’izo nkingi;<verse eid="1KI 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />vya bicurano bisa n’amakomamanga amajana ane yo kuri ya migufu ibiri; imirongo ibiri y’ibisa n’amakomamanga ku mugufu umwumwe usharije ya myashi iri ku mitwe ya za nkingi;<verse eid="1KI 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />ivyo guterekako ya mabesani cumi hamwe n’ayo mabesani cumi nyene;<verse eid="1KI 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />ca kiyaga na vya bibumbano vy’amashuri cumi n’abiri cari giteretseko;<verse eid="1KI 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />za nkono, vya vyaruzo hamwe n’ibikombe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:45">Ivyo bikoresho vyose Huramu yacuriye umwami Salomo ku bw’iyo Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabicuze mu butare bw’umwakaka uhinguwe neza.<verse eid="1KI 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Umwami ategeka ko bifyaturirwa mu maforoma y’ibumba mu kiyaya ca Yorodani hagati ya Sukoti na Zaretani. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Salomo ntiyiriwe arapima ivyo bintu yakoresheje vyose; vyari vyinshi ku buryo igipimo c’ubutare bw’umwakaka bwakoreshejwe kitashobora kumenyekana.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Salomo yongera akora ibikoresho vyose vyari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">igicaniro c’inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">imeza y’inzahabu yo gushirako ya mikate ihezagiye,<verse eid="1KI 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />vya biterekwako amatara vy’inzahabu ihinguwe neza: bitanu i buryo na bitanu i bubamfu, imbere y’Ahera Cane;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:49">ya mashurwe acuzwe mu nzahabu, amatara n’ivyo kuyora umunyota vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu;<verse eid="1KI 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />amabesani, imbugita, utubakure, ibikombe n’udusahani tw’umunyota bicuzwe mu nzahabu ihinguye neza;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:50">n’amapata y’inzugi z’Ahera Cane n’ay’inzugi z’icumba gikuru c’Ingoro, yose akozwe mu nzahabu.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Igikorwa cose Salomo yakoreye Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> giheze, aca yinjiza ibintu vyose se Dawidi yari yaragize inyegu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: ifeza, inzahabu n’ibindi bikoresho, abishira mu bubiko bw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Isandugu y’Isezerano yinjizwa mu Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Nuko umwami Salomo aca atumako abakuru b’Abisirayeli, abatware b’imiryango bose n’abaserukira amazu y’Abisirayeli, bakoranira i Yerusalemu kugira ngo bazane Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bayikure aho yari iri i Siyoni mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, bayijane mu kibanza gishasha kiri muri iyo Ngoro. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Abisirayeli bose bakoranira imbere y’umwami Salomo ku musi mukuru w’insago, hari mu kwezi kw’indwi ari kwo Etanimu.<verse eid="1KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Abakuru bose b’Abisirayeli bamaze gushika, abaherezi baterura ya sandugu barayidugana, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />badugana Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, badugana n’ibikoresho vyose vyakoreshwa muri ryo. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Umwami Salomo n’ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli bari bakoraniye hamwe na we bari imbere y’iyo sandugu, batanga ibimazi vyinshi vy’intama n’inka bitashoboye kwandikwa canke ngo biharurwe.<verse eid="1KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Abo baherezi baca bajana iyo Sandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aho yateguriwe mu gice c’imbere mu Ngoro, ari ho hitwa Ahera Cane, baca bayishira musi y’amababa ya ba bakerubi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Abo bakerubi bari bashanje amababa hejuru y’aho iyo sandugu yari iri, agapfuka isandugu hamwe n’imyamba bayireruza. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Iyo myamba yari miremire ku buryo umuntu ari Ahera yashobora kubona aho igarukira. Ariko umuntu atarashika Ahera, ntivyashoboka ko ayibona; kandi iracariho gushika n’uwu musi. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Nta kindi kintu cari muri iyo sandugu kiretse vya bisate vy’amabuye Mose yashiramwo ari i Horebu, aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagiraniye isezerano n’Abisirayeli bamaze kuva muri Egiputa.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Abaherezi bamaze gusohoka bakava muri ico cumba c’Ahera, igicu cakaka kiraza cuzura mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Abaherezi ntibaba bagishobora gukora igikorwa cabo kubera ico gicu, kuko ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwari bwuzuye Ingoro y’Uhoraho.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Maze Salomo avuga ati: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, wavuze ko uba mu gicu c’umwijima w’umuzitanya. <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Ariko jewe nakwubakiye vy’ukuri Ingoro y’igitangaza, ikibanza uzokwiberamwo ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli rigihagaze ngaho, umwami arahindukira arabahezagira. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Maze avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:15">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli, ahimbazwe, we ashikije n’amaboko yiwe ivyo yari yarasezeraniye data Dawidi n’akanwa kiwe, aho yavuga ati: <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Uhereye umusi nakuriye ubwoko bwanje bw’Abisirayeli muri Egiputa, sinigeze ntoranya igisagara na kimwe co mu miryango ya Isirayeli ngo cubakwemwo Ingoro yitirirwa izina ryanje, ariko natoranije Dawidi kugira ngo abe ari we aganza abantu banje b’Abisirayeli.’<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />Data Dawidi yari afise ku mutima umugambi wo kwubakira Ingoro izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amubwira ati: ‘Wagize neza kwiyumvira kwubakira Ingoro izina ryanje, <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />ariko si wewe uzoyubaka. Umuhungu wawe, uwo wivyariye, ni we azokwubakira Ingoro izina ryanje.’<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yazigamye isezerano ryiwe. Yansubije mu gishingo ca data Dawidi; none ubu nicaye ku ntebe y’ubwami bwa Isirayeli, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabisezeranye, kandi nanje nubatse Ingoro yo guhesha icubahiro izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Nateguye ikibanza muri yo co kubikamwo ya sandugu, irimwo rya sezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagiranye na ba sogokuruza igihe yabakura muri Egiputa.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Maze Salomo ahagarara imbere y’igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’imbere y’ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli agorora amaboko ayerekeje mw’ijuru. <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />Nuko aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:23">“Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana ya Isirayeli, nta yindi Mana ihwanye nawe mw’ijuru hejuru no mw’isi hasi, wewe uzigama isezerano wagiriye abasavyi bawe, bagukurikira n’imitima yabo yose. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Wazigamye isezerano wagiriye data Dawidi umusavyi wawe, urisezeranishije akanwa kawe, none uwu musi urishikishije amaboko yawe.<verse eid="1KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana ya Isirayeli, zigamira umusavyi wawe Dawidi ari we data, isezerano wamugiriye, aho wavuga uti: ‘Mu ruvyaro rwawe, ntihazokwigera habura uwuba ku ngoma ya Isirayeli, nirwagendera mu Vyagezwe vyanje nk’uko wabigendeyemwo.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />None rero Mana ya Isirayeli, shitsa amasezerano wasezeraniye data Dawidi umusavyi wawe.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />Ariko none vy’ukuri Imana izoba kw’isi? Ko amajuru, mbere n’amajuru asumba ayandi, udashobora kuyakwirwamwo, mbe ndareka iyi Ngoro nubatse! <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Ariko wumvirize ugusenga n’ukwinginga kwanje, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yanje. Wumve ugutakamba n’ugusenga kw’umusavyi wawe ari imbere yawe uwu musi. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Inyonga zawe zize zame ziri kuri iyi Ngoro ijoro n’umurango, aha hantu wavuzeko uti: ‘Izina ryanje rizokwama aha.’ Uzokwame wumva amasengesho umusavyi wawe azosengera hano hantu. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Uze wumvirize ukwinginga kw’umusavyi wawe n’ukw’abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli nibasenga batumbereye iyi ngoro. Uze ubumvirize uri mw’ijuru, aho uba, kandi niwabumva, ubaharire.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />Umuntu niyagirira nabi mugenziwe maze bigasabwa ko bamurahiza ko atabikoze, akaza akarahirira imbere y’igicaniro cawe kiri muri iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />uze uvyumve uri mw’ijuru ucire urubanza abantu bawe. Uwakoze ikibi atsindwe, ivyo yakoze bimusubire ku mutwe kandi hatsinde uwutacumuye, umwerekane kandi bimenyekane ko ata kimwagira.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />Abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli nibatsindwa n’abansi babo kuko bagucumuyeko maze bagahindukira bagahimbaza izina ryawe, bagasenga binginga imbere yawe bari muri iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />uzobumve uri mw’ijuru, uharire icaha c’abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli, ubagarukane mu gihugu wahaye ba sekuruza.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />Ijuru niryugarwa imvura ntigwe kuko abantu bawe bagucumuyeko, maze bagasenga batumbereye aha hantu bagahimbaza izina ryawe, bagahindukira bakava mu caha cabo, umaze kubateza ivyago, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />uze ubumve uri mw’ijuru, uharire icaha c’abasavyi bawe, ari bo bwoko bwawe bw’Abisirayeli. Uze ubigishe inzira zawe, maze urekurire imvura mu gihugu wahaye abantu bawe nk’umugabane.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />Ikigoyi canke ikiza nivyatera mu gihugu, canke akaranda canke ururyi, inzige canke ibihori, canke umwansi wabo akabugariza mu gisagara kimwe mu vyo babamwo, ikiza ico ari co cose canke ingwara iyo ari yo yose nivyabashikako, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />maze hakagira na bamwe bo mu Bisirayeli basenga ku bw’imibabaro yo mu mitima yabo, bakarabisha ibiganza vyabo kuri iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />nawe uze wumve uri mw’ijuru, aho wibera. Uze ubaharire kandi ugire ico ukoze, ugirire umuntu wese ibihwanye n’ivyo yakoze, kuko uzi imitima yabo: ni wewe wenyene uzi imitima y’abana b’abantu bose. <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />Ni ho bazogutinya imisi yose bazoba mu gihugu wahaye ba sogokuruza.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />Mbere n’aho yoba umunyamahanga atari uwo mu bwoko bwawe bw’Abisirayeli, ariko akaza avuye mu gihugu ca kure ku bw’izina ryawe, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />kuko bazokwumva ivy’izina ryawe rihambaye n’ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi kandi kugoroye; niyaza akagusenga atumbereye iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />uze umwumve uri mw’ijuru, aho uba, ukorere uwo munyamahanga ico azoba agusavye cose, kugira ngo amahanga yose yo kw’isi amenye izina ryawe akwubahe, nk’uko abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli bakora, kandi bamenye ko iyi Ngoro nubatse yitirirwa izina ryawe.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />Abantu bawe nibaja mu ntambara kugwanya abansi babo, aho uzobarungika hose, maze bagasenga Uhoraho batumbereye iki gisagara watoranije n’iyi Ngoro nubakiye izina ryawe; <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />nuko uze wumve ugusenga kwabo no kwinginga kwabo uri mw’ijuru, ubatabare.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />Nibaramuka bagucumuyeko, kuko ata muntu adacumura, hanyuma uburake bwawe bukabaziriringira, maze ukabarekurira mu maboko y’abansi babo bakabatwara nk’inyagano mu bihugu vyabo, vyaba ivya hafi canke ivya kure; <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />maze nibahindukira mu mitima yabo bari mu gihugu bajanywemwo nk’inyagano, bakihana bakagusaba imbabazi bari muri ico gihugu c’ababanyaze bakavuga bati: ‘twaracumuye, twakoze nabi, twakoze ivyo kwankwa urunuka,’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />maze bakagaruka kuri wewe n’imitima yabo yose n’imishaha yabo yose, bari mu gihugu c’abansi babo babagize inyagano, hanyuma bagasenga baraba mu gihugu wahaye ba sekuruza babo, no ku gisagara watoranije hamwe no kuri iyi Ngoro nubakiye izina ryawe, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />nuko uri mw’ijuru, aho uba, uze wumve ugusenga kwabo n’ugutakamba kwabo, uheze ubagwanirire. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Uheze uharire abantu bawe, bagucumuyeko, ubaharire ibibi vyose bazoba bakoze, maze utume ababatwaye babagirira impuhwe, <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />kuko ari ubwoko bwawe, inyegu yawe, abo wakuye muri Egiputa, rya tanure rivugutira ivyuma bigashonga.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />Niwumve ugusenga kwanje jewe umusavyi wawe, n’ukwinginga kw’ubwoko bwawe bwa Isirayeli, kandi uzokwame ubumva igihe cose bazoba bagutakambiye. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Kuko wabatoranije mu mahanga yose yo kw’isi ukabagira inyegu yawe, nk’uko wabivugiye mu kanwa k’umusavyi wawe Mose igihe wakura ba sogokuruza bacu muri Egiputa, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Salomo ahejeje gusenga no kwinginga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> gutyo, aca arahaguruka ava imbere y’igicaniro aho yari apfukamye, ashanje amaboko ayarabishije kw’ijuru. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Ahezagira ikoraniro ryose rya Isirayeli, avuga n’ijwi rirenga ati:<verse eid="1KI 8:55" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nashimwe, we yahaye akaruhuko ubwoko bwiwe bwa Isirayeli nk’uko yari yarabisezeranye. Nta sezerano na rimwe yasezeranye aciye ku musavyi wiwe Mose ritashitse. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu azobana natwe nk’uko yabanye na ba sogokuruza bacu, ntazokwigera aduta, ntazokwigera aduheba. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Niyigarurire imitima yacu, kugira ngo dushobore kugendera mu mabwirizwa, amategeko n’ivyo yihanikiririje ba sogokuruza bacu. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Kandi aya majambo yanje y’amasengesho nasengeye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aze yame imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu ijoro n’umurango, kugira ngo aze yishure umusavyi wiwe n’ubwoko bwiwe bwa Isirayeli ibihwanye n’ivyo bazoba bakeneye ku musi ku musi, <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />kugira ngo abo kw’isi bose bamenye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari Imana, kandi ko ata yindi Mana iriho. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Imitima yanyu na yo niyegurirwe rwose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, muzokwame mugendera mu mategeko no mu mabwirizwa yayo, nk’uko mubigenderamwo uno musi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingoro yegurirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Nuko umwami n’Abisirayeli bose bashikanira ibimazi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Salomo ashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amashikanwa y’ishimwe agizwe n’impfizi ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bibiri n’intama ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ibiri. Nuko umwami n’Abisirayeli bose bashikiriza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> iyo Ngoro.<verse eid="1KI 8:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Uwo musi nyene, umwami ashikiriza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikibanza kiri imbere y’Ingoro, ahatangira n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ivy’ifu hamwe n’ivy’ishimwe, kuko igicaniro c’umwakaka cari imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> cari gito cane, kitashobora gukwirwako ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ivy’ifu n’ivy’ishimwe.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Nuko umwami Salomo ari kumwe n’Abisirayeli bose bahimbaza uwo musi mukuru. Hari hakoraniye abantu isinzi bari baje bava kure cane mu buraruko i Lebo-Hamati gushika epfo kure mu bumanuko ku kagezi ka Egiputa. Bamara imisi indwi bahimbaza uwo musi mukuru w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, biyongera iyindi misi indwi, yose hamwe iba cumi n’ine. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Ku musi ugira umunani umwami Salomo asezera abantu, basubira iwabo. Na bo bahezagira umwami, bataha banezerewe cane, imitima yabo inezerejwe n’ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye umusavyi wayo Dawidi n’abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yiyereka Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Salomo ahejeje kwubaka Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ikirimba c’umwami, agashika no ku vyo yari yaripfuje gukora, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amwiyereka ubugira kabiri, nka kumwe yari yaramwiyerekeye i Gibeyoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 9:3">“Numvise ugusenga n’ukwinginga kwawe, maze ndobanura iyi Ngoro wubatse, ngo yitirirwe izina ryanje ibihe bidashira. Amaso yanje n’umutima wanje bizokwama kuri yo.<verse eid="1KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Nawe niwagendera imbere yanje mu bwizigirwa n’umutima utunganye no mu bugororotsi nk’uko so Dawidi yabigira, ugakora ivyo nagutegetse vyose, ugakurikiza amategeko n’amabwirizwa yanje; <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />nzokomeza intebe yawe y’ubwami mu Bisirayeli ibihe vyose, nk’uko nasezeraniye so Dawidi aho navuga nti: ‘Mu ruvyaro rwawe ntihazokwigera habura uwuganza ku ngoma y’Abisirayeli.’<verse eid="1KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Ariko wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe nimwamvako, mugata amategeko n’amabwirizwa nabahaye, mukaja gukorera izindi mana mukazisenga; <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />nanje nzorandura Abisirayeli mu gihugu nabahaye, n’iyi Ngoro neguriye izina ryanje nzoyishibura imve mu maso. Ihanga rya Isirayeli nzorigira iciro ry’imigani mu yandi mahanga. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Kandi naho iyi Ngoro yari iteye igomwe, abazoyica i ruhande bazogira ubwoba batangare, hanyuma bitwengere bavuga bati: ‘Ni igiki catumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agirira atya iki gihugu n’iyi Ngoro?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Abantu bazobishura bati: ‘Ni ukubera bataye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza yabakuye muri Egiputa, bagahindukirira izindi mana, bakazisenga kandi bakazikorera; ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabateje ivyo vyago vyose.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibindi bikorwa Salomo yakoze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Haheze imyaka mirongo ibiri, iyo Salomo yubatsemwo izo nyubakwa zibiri ari zo Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ikirimba c’umwami, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />umwami Salomo aca aha Hiramu umwami w’i Tiro ibisagara mirongo ibiri vy’i Galilaya, kuko Hiramu ari we yamuhaye amasederi n’ubujwari hamwe n’inzahabu yari akeneye. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Ariko Hiramu avuye i Tiro akaja kuraba ivyo bisagara Salomo yamuhaye, ntivyamuhimbara. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Aramubaza ati: “Ibi ni ibisagara nyabaki umpaye ga mugenzi?” Aca avyita intara ya Kabuli, ni ko hitwa gushika n’ubu. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Hiramu yari yahaye umwami italanto ijana na mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 4.</char></note> z’inzahabu.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Ibi bikurikira ni vyo vyerekana ibikorwa biruhisha umwami Salomo yategekanije kugira ngo ashobore kwubaka Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ikirimba ciwe, impome zishigikira inkombe, inzitiro za Yerusalemu, hamwe n’ibisagara Hazori Megido na Gezeri. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Farawo umwami wa Egiputa yari yarateye igisagara ca Gezeri, aragifata, aragiturira. Yica Abanyakanani bakibamwo, maze agiha umukobwa wiwe nk’ingabire yo ku bukwe bwiwe igihe yarongorwa na Salomo. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Salomo aca asubiramwo kwubaka Gezeri, yubaka n’ibisagara vy’epfo ya Beti-Horoni, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />Bayalati na Tadumori<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Giheburayo bashobora gusoma </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tamari.</char></note> mu ntara iri mu gihugu ciwe mu bugaragwa, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />hamwe n’ibisagara vyose vy’ububiko, n’ivy’imikogote n’amafarasi yiwe; ivyo yipfuje vyose kwubaka i Yerusalemu, i Libani no mu gihugu cose aho yaganza.<verse eid="1KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Hari hakiriho amasigarira y’Abamori, Abaheti, Abaperizi, Abahiwi n’Abayebusi. Abo bo ntibari Abisirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />Yari amoko Abisirayeli batashoboye kurandura, yakomoka ku mahanga yahora aba muri ico gihugu. Nuko Salomo aca afata abo bantu bose abagira abagurano, abashingira ibikebere ngo bakore ibikorwa vy’agahato, nk’uko biri kugeza n’uwu musi. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Ariko Salomo nta Mwisirayeli n’umwe yagize umugurano, ahubwo yabagize abo kugwana: abatware, intwazangabo, abasoda bakurubakuru, abagwanira ku mikogote n’abarongozi babo. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Abo batware bari bajejwe ibikorwa vya Salomo, kandi amajana atanu na mirongo itanu bo muri bo bagakurikirana abantu bari ku bikorwa vy’umwami.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Umukobwa wa Farawo amaze kuva mu Gisagara ca Dawidi akaja mu ngoro Salomo yamwubakiye, Salomo yaciye yubaka impome zikingira inyubakwa.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Salomo yama atanga gatatu ku mwaka ibimazi bituriwe n’ibimazi vy’ishimwe, akabitangira ku gicaniro yubakiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, akabiturirana n’ibimota neza imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Uko ni ko yatunganije ibikorwa vyo muri iyo Ngoro.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Umwami Salomo yongera akora amato, ayakorera ahitwa Eziyoni Geberi, ikivuko co hafi ya Elati muri Edomu, ku nkengera y’Ikiyaga Gitukura. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Maze Hiramu arungika abahinga bo gutwara ubwato ngo bakorane n’abakozi ba Salomo. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Nuko barasoza bashika muri Ofiru, bagaruka bazanye italanto amajana ane na mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 16.</char></note> z’inzahabu bazishikiriza umwami Salomo.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Umwamikazi w’i Sheba agendera Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Umwamikazi w’i Sheba yumvise ingene Salomo ari umuntu ahambaye, n’ukuntu yahaye icubahiro izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aja kumugerageresha ibibazo bigoye cane. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Ashika i Yerusalemu ari kumwe n’abamuherekeje benshi, ingamiya zikoreye ibimota neza, inzahabu nyinshi cane n’amabuye y’agaciro, maze aja aho Salomo ari aganira na we ivyo yiyumvira vyose. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Salomo yishura ibibazo vyose yamubajije, ntihagira na kimwe kinanira umwami kumusigurira. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Umwamikazi w’i Sheba abonye ubwenge bwose bwa Salomo n’ingoro yubatse, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />ivyokurya vyo ku meza yiwe, ivyicaro vy’abatware biwe, abakozi biwe bagabura ku meza n’imyambaro yabo, abamuhereza ivyo kunywa, n’ibimazi bituriwe yatanga mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aratangara cane.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Abarira umwami ati: “Ivyo numviye mu gihugu canje ku vyerekeye ivyo wakoze hamwe n’ubwenge bwawe, nsanze vyari ivy’ukuri. <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Ariko sinari navyizeye gushika nishikiye hano nkavyibonera n’amaso yanje ubwanje. Mu vy’ukuri, nta n’igice bambwiye c’ingene ubwenge bwawe bungana; birarengeye kure cane ivyo bambwiye. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Erega abantu bawe barahiriwe! Eka n’abagendanyi bawe na bo nyene barahiriwe, bo bama bahagaze imbere yawe imisi yose, bumviriza ivy’ubwenge bwawe! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe iragahimbazwa, kuko wayihimbaye maze ikagushira ku ngoma y’Abisirayeli ngo uganze mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe. Ku bw’urukundo rudashira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> afitiye Isirayeli, yakugize umwami kugira ngo uganze mu butungane no mu kugororoka.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Maze aca ashikanira umwami italanto ijana na mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 4.</char></note> z’inzahabu, ibimota neza vyinshi, n’amabuye y’igiciro. Nta n’umwe yongeye gushikanira umwami ibimota neza bingana n’ivyo umwamikazi w’i Sheba yashikaniye umwami Salomo.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />I ruhande y’ivyo, amato ya Hiramu yazanye inzahabu zivuye muri Ofiru, yongera azana n’imbaho nyinshi z’igiti ca alumugi hamwe n’amabuye y’agaciro. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Umwami aca akoresha izo mbaho mu gushigikira Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hamwe n’ikirimba ciwe; yongera azikoramwo amakembe n’inanga vy’abacuraranzi. Nta mbaho za alumugi zingana gutyo zari bwaze kandi nta zirasubira kuboneka kugeza n’uwu musi.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Umwami Salomo aha umwamikazi w’i Sheba ivyo yipfuza n’ivyo yasavye vyose, amwihera n’izindi ngabire nk’uko umugenzo w’ubugwaneza bw’umwami Salomo wari uri. Maze arahaguruka asubira mu gihugu ciwe n’abari kumwe na we.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’ubutunzi bwa Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Ingabire Salomo yaronka ku mwaka ku mwaka zangana n’italanto amajana atandatu na mirongo itandatu na zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 25.</char></note> z’inzahabu, <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />udashizemwo ubundi butunzi yaronka biciye mu makori abadandaza batanga hamwe n’ayava mu bami bose bo muri Arabiya n’abatware bo mu gihugu ciwe.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Umwami Salomo acurisha inkinzo nininini amajana abiri mu nzahabu; imwimwe yose itwara shekeli amajana atandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 6,9.</char></note> z’inzahabu. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Acurisha n’izindi nkinzo ntonto amajana atatu mu nzahabu, imwe yose ikajako ingero mina zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3,5.</char></note> z’inzahabu. Umwami aca azibika mu ngoro yise Ishamba ry’i Libani.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Hanyuma umwami akoresha intebe y’ubwami nini isharijwe n’amahembe y’inzovu ayomekako inzahabu ihinguwe neza. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Iyo ntebe yari ifise ingazi zitandatu, kandi ku mutwe w’aho begamira hari hameze nk’umuzingi. Ku mpande zose z’iyo ntebe hari ivyo gushirako amaboko, kandi hari n’ibishushanyo vy’intare bibiri bihagaze i ruhande y’amaboko. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Hari n’ibindi bishushanyo cumi na bibiri vy’intare, kimwekimwe ku mpera y’ingazi yose muri zimwe zitandatu. Nta ntebe nk’iyo yari bwigere iboneka mu bwami na bumwe. <verse eid="1KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Ibikombe vyose vy’umwami Salomo vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu, n’ibikoresho vyose vyo mu ngoro yise Ikibira c’i Libani vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu ihinguwe neza. Nta na kimwe cari gikozwe mw’ifeza, kuko ifeza yafatwa nk’aho ifise agaciro gato mu gihe ca Salomo. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Umwami yari afise amato yo kudandaza yaja i Tarushishi yajana n’aya Hiramu. Uko imyaka itatu iheze ayo mato yaba agarutse avuye i Tarushishi, azanye inzahabu, ifeza, amahembe y’inzovu, inkende n’amadendo.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Maze umwami Salomo aba agahambaye mu butunzi no mu bwenge kurusha abandi bami bose bo kw’isi. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Abantu bose bo kw’isi bama basaba umubonano kwa Salomo ngo bumvirize ubwenge Imana yamuhaye. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Ku mwaka ku mwaka, abaja kumuraba umwe wese yagenda amushikaniye ifeza n’inzahabu, amakanzu, ibigwanisho, ibimota neza, amafarasi n’inyumbu.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Maze Salomo yegeranya imikogote y’intambara n’amafarasi menshi. Yari afise imikogote igihumbi n’amajana ane, n’amafarasi ibihumbi cumi na bibiri. Bimwe abibika mu bisagara vy’imikogote, ibindi abigumiza hafi yiwe i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Umwami agwiza ifeza i Yerusalemu zisigara zimeze nk’amabuye, imbaho z’agaciro z’amasederi na zo ziragwira zimera nk’ibiti vy’imisukomora vyo mu biyaya vy’i Buyuda. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Amafarasi ya Salomo yari yayakuye muri Egiputa n’i Kilikiya; abadandaza b’umwami bari bayaguriye muri Kilikiya ku giciro gisanzwe. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Umukogote umwe bawugura muri Egiputa shekeli amajana atandatu z’ifeza, ifarasi imwe na yo bakayigura shekeli ijana na mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ikilo 1,7.</char></note>. Kandi abo badandaza ni bo banabigurisha no ku bami bose b’Abaheti n’ab’Abarameya.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abagore ba Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Umwami Salomo akunda abagore benshi b’abanyamahangakazi. I ruhande y’umukobwa wa Farawo, yari afise abagore b’Abanyamowabukazi, Abamonikazi, Abanyedomukazi, Abanyesidonikazi n’Abahetikazi. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Abo bose bava mu mahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaravuzeko ati: “Ntimuze murongore abagore bo muri bo, kuko nimwabikora bazobakwegera mu gusenga imana zabo.” Ariko Salomo we ahitamwo kubakunda n’aho vyari uko. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Yari afise abagore amajana indwi bava mu miryango y’abami, n’abandi amajana atatu b’incoreke, maze abo bagore baramuzimiza, bamutesha inzira y’Imana. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Uko Salomo yasaza ni ko abagore biwe bakwegakwegera umutima wiwe ku zindi mana, ntiyaba aciyeguriye wese <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe, nk’uko se yari yiyeguriye wese <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Nuko akurikira Ashitaroti imanakazi y’Abanyesidoni, na Moleki ikizira c’ubuyobe c’Abamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Uko ni ko Salomo yakoze ibizira mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntiyakurikira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umutima wiwe wose nk’uko se Dawidi yabikoze.<verse eid="1KI 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Mw’itaba ry’umusozi uri amaja mu buseruko bwa Yerusalemu, Salomo ahubaka ikibanza co gusengeramwo Kemoshi, ikizira c’ubuyobe c’imana y’Abanyamowabu, n’ica Moleki ikizira c’ubuyobe c’imana y’Abamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Yubakira n’abandi bagore bose b’abanyamahangakazi ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo nk’ivyo, na bo bakabishikaniramwo imana zabo imibavu yo guturira, bakahatangira n’ibimazi.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buziriringira Salomo, kuko umutima wiwe wari wavuye ku Mana ya Isirayeli, kandi yari yamwiyeretse incuro zibiri zose. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarihanikirije Salomo ngo ntazosenge izindi mana, ariko Salomo ntiyamwumvira. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Salomo ati: “Ko wakoze ivyo, ntuzigame isezerano n’amabwirizwa naguhaye, ubwami bwawe nzobutabura ndabuhe umwe mu bakozi bawe. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Ariko ku bwa so Dawidi, sinzobikora ukiriho. Nzobutaburira mu maboko y’umuhungu wawe. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Kandi naho bizoba bimeze gutyo, sinzomunyaga ubwami bwose, nzomuha intara imwe ku bwa Dawidi umusavyi wanje, no ku bwa Yerusalemu nitoranirije.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abansi ba Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahagurutsa Hadadi Umunyedomu wo mu muryango w’abami ba Edomu, agwanya Salomo. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Dawidi akigwanya Abanyedomu, Yowabu umukuru w’abasoda yari yaduze guhamba Abisirayeli bari baguye ku rugamba, asiga ahoneje abagabo bose b’Abanyedomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yowabu n’ingabo z’Abisirayeli baca bamarayo amezi atandatu, kugeza bahoneje abagabo bose muri Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Hadadi yari akiri umwana w’umuhungu igihe yahungira muri Egiputa ari kumwe n’abatware b’Abanyedomu bakoreye se. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Bahunze bava i Midiyani, baja i Parani. Bahitana abantu i Parani baja muri Egiputa kwa Farawo umwami wa Egiputa, Farawo aha Hadadi inzu n’itongo, amuha n’ivyokurya.<verse eid="1KI 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Farawo yarakunda Hadadi cane bituma amuha uwavukana n’umugore wiwe, umwamikazi Tahipenesi, aba muka Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Uwo mugore avyaye umwana kuri Hadadi yitwa Genubati, umwamikazi Tahipenesi aca amurerera ku kirimba hamwe n’abana ba Farawo.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Hadadi akiri muri Egiputa, yumva ko Dawidi yahambije ba sekuruza, ko na Yowabu umukuru w’abasoda na we nyene yapfuye; ni ko kubwira Farawo ati: “Ndeka nsubire mu gihugu canje.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Farawo aramubaza ati: “Mbega hari ico wabuze ngaha aho ugomba gusubira mu gihugu cawe?” Hadadi amwishura ati: “Nta co nabuze, ariko ndeka ngende!”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yongera avyurira Salomo uwundi mwansi ari we Rezoni mwene Eliyada. Rezoni yari yarahunze shebuja, Hadadezeri umwami w’i Zoba, <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />hanyuma aba umukuru w’akagwi k’abagwanyi. Dawidi amaze gufata Hadadezeri, Razoni n’abantu biwe baciye bahungira i Damasiko, aca yigira umwami waho. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Rezoni aba umwansi wa Isirayeli imyaka yose Salomo yabayeho, abakorera ikibi nk’ico Hadadi yabakorera. Rezoni aba umwami w’i Siriya, kandi agirira Isirayeli urwanko rwinshi.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerobowamu agarariza Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Yerobowamu mwene Nebati na we nyene agarariza umwami. Yari umutware umwe mu batware ba Salomo. Yava mu gisagara ca Zereda muri Efurayimu, nyina yari umupfakazi yitwa Zeruwa.<verse eid="1KI 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Ukugarariza kwiwe kwagenze gutya: igihe Salomo yariko arubaka ikibuga yongera asanura ahasambutse h’uruzitiro rw’igisagara ca se Dawidi. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yerobowamu yari umusore w’umunyenkomezi nyinshi. Salomo abonye ingene ari umunyabikorwa, aca amuha gukoresha abagurano bo mu muryango wa Yosefu.<verse eid="1KI 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Umusi umwe Yerobowamu yari avuye i Yerusalemu, Ahiya umuvugishwa w’i Shilo aza kumutegera yambaye umutamana mushasha. Bashitse mu gahinga ari babiri bonyene, <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Ahiya afata wa mutamana mushasha yari yambaye awutaburamwo ibice cumi na bibiri. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Aca abarira Yerobowamu ati: “Akira ibice cumi, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze ati: ‘Ehe raba ngiye gutabura ubwami bwa Salomo ndaguhemwo imiryango cumi. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Ariko ku bw’umusavyi wanje Dawidi n’igisagara ca Yerusalemu nitoranirije mu miryango yose ya Isirayeli, azosigarana umuryango umwe. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Ivyo nzobikora kuko bantaye, bagasenga Ashitaroti imanakazi y’Abanyesidoni, Kemoshi imana y’Abanyamowabu, Moleki imana y’Abamoni, ntibagendera mu nzira zanje canke ngo bakore ibiroranye mu nyonga zanje, ntibazigama amategeko n’amabwirizwa yanje nk’uko se Dawidi yabikora.<verse eid="1KI 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Ariko sinzomutwara ubwami bwose. Ku bw’umusavyi wanje Dawidi, uwo nitoranirije, akagendera mu mabwirizwa n’amategeko yanje, nzoreka Salomo aganze gushika apfe. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Umuhungu wiwe ni we nzokwaka ubwami, ndabuguhemwo imiyango cumi. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Umuhungu wiwe nzomuha umuryango umwe, kugira ngo ku ngoma haze hame hariho uwuganza akomoka kuri Dawidi, amere kurya kw’itara ryakira i Yerusalemu, igisagara natoranije nkacitirira izina ryanje. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Ariko wewe, nzokwimika ku ngoma ya Isirayeli, utware aho umutima wawe wipfuza hose, ube umwami wa Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Niwakora ivyo nzogutegeka vyose, ukagendera mu mabwirizwa yanje, ukagendera mu nzira zanje, ugakora ibibereye mu nyonga zanje mu gukurikiza amabwirizwa n’amategeko yanje, nk’uko umusavyi wanje Dawidi yabigenza, nzobana nawe. Nzokwubakira inzu yama ku ngoma nk’iyo nubakiye Dawidi, nongere ndaguhe Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Uko ni ko nzohana uruvyaro rwa Dawidi kubera icaha ca Salomo, ariko ntibazokwama mu gihano ibihe vyose.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Salomo agerageza kwica Yerobowamu, ariko Yerobowamu aca ahungira kwa Shishaki umwami wa Egiputa, agumayo gushika Salomo apfuye.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Salomo, ivyo yaranguye vyose hamwe n’ubwenge bwiwe, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’Ibikorwa vya Salomo? <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Igihe Salomo yamaze ku ngoma i Yerusalemu aganza Abisirayeli bose ni imyaka mirongo ine. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Nuko Salomo arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa mu gisagara ca se Dawidi. Maze umuhungu wiwe Rehobowamu amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli bagarariza Rehobowamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Rehobowamu aja i Shekemu aho Abisirayeli bose bari bakoraniye kugira ngo bamwimike abe umwami. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Yerobowamu mwene Nebati avyumvise ari muri Egiputa, aho yari yarahungiye umwami Salomo, aca aragaruka. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Nuko batumako Yerobowamu, maze we n’ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli baja aho Rehobowamu ari bamubwira bati: <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“So yadutwaje umukazo, none turagusavye utugabanirize umuruho w’ibikorwa bigoye yadutegetse gukora, natwe tuzoba abasavyi bawe.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Rehobowamu abishura ati: “Nimutahe mbanze ndavyiyumvire, muze mugaruke inyuma y’imisi itatu.” Nuko abo bantu baca baragenda.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Umwami Rehobowamu aca agisha inama abatware bakoranye na se Salomo akiriho. Arababaza ati: “Mungiriye inama ki? Aba bantu ndabishure iki?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Na bo baramwishura bati: “Uyu musi niwumvira aba bantu ukabagirira neza, ukabaha inyishu nziza, bazokwama bagukorera ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Ariko Rehobowamu yanka impanuro abahumure bamuhaye, aca asiguza abasore bakuranye na we bari mu bamukorera. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Arababaza ati: “Mumpanuye iki? Nokwishura iki aba bantu bambwiye bati: ‘Turemurure umutwaro so yaturemetse’?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Ba basore bakuranye na we bamwishura bati: “Abo bantu bakubwiye bati, ‘So yaturemetse imitwaro ituvuna, ariko weho uturemurure iyo mitwaro’; babwire uti, ‘Urutoke rwanje rw’uruhererezi rusumvya ubunini umugongo wa data. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Data yabaremereje ibikorwa vyinshi, ni ko: ariko jeho nzobibaremereza gusumba. Data yabakubitisha ikimoko, jeho nzobarisha sikoropiyo!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Haheze imisi itatu, Yerobowamu na ba bantu bagaruka kuraba umwami Rehobowamu, nk’uko yari yabibabwiye, ati: “Muze mugaruke mu misi itatu.” <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Maze umwami abishura abakankamira, kuko yari yanse impanuro yahawe n’abahumure, <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />akumvira impanuro z’imisore yakuranye na we. Abishura ati: “Data yabaremereje ibikorwa bigoye, jeho nzobibaremereza gusumba. Data yabakubitisha ikimoko, jeho nzobarisha sikoropiyo.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Nuko umwami ntiyumvira abo bantu, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we yatumye vyose bigenda gutyo, kugira ngo ashitse ico yari yarasezeraniye Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, abicishije kuri Ahiya w’i Shilo.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Maze Abisirayeli bose babonye ko umwami yanse kubumviriza, bishura umwami bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">“Hari umugabane dufise mu muryango wa Dawidi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Nta co twiteze kuronka kuri mwene Isayi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Yemwe Bisirayeli, mwese nimusubire mu ngo zanyu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Nawe Dawidi, urimenya urabe inzu yawe!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1KI 12:16">Nuko Abisirayeli basubira iwabo. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Ariko Abisirayeli bagumye baba mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda, bobo Rehobowamu yagumye abaganza.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Umwami Rehobowamu arungika Adoramu yari ajejwe ibikorwa vy’agahato, kugira ngo agarukane umutekano, ariko Abisirayeli bose bamutera amabuye arapfa. Maze umwami Rehobowamu, yurira umukogote wiwe arahunga aja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Uko ni ko imiryango ya Isirayeli yo mu buraruko yanse kuganzwa n’inzu ya Dawidi gushika n’uwu musi.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Abisirayeli bumvise ko Yerobowamu yagarutse avuye muri Egiputa, baca batumako ikoraniro, bamugira umwami wa Isirayeli. Umuryango wa Yuda ni wo wonyene wasigaye uyoboka abo mu muryango wa Dawidi.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Rehobowamu ashitse i Yerusalemu, akoranya Abayuda bose n’umuryango w’Ababenyamini, abatoranyamwo imisore ishobora kugwana ibihumbi ijana na mirongo umunani kugira ngo baje gutera Abisirayeli, bagarurire ubwami Rehobowamu mwene Salomo.<verse eid="1KI 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Ariko ijambo ry’Imana riza kuri Shemaya umuntu w’Imana, riti: <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Barira Rehobowamu mwene Salomo umwami w’i Buyuda, n’abo mu muryango wa Yuda n’uwa Benyamini, hamwe n’abasigaye bose, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ntimuduge kugwanya abavukanyi banyu ari bo Bisirayeli. Umwe wese muri mwebwe nasubire iwe, kuko ivyabaye vyose ari jewe nabigize.’ ” Nuko bumvira ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, basubira iwabo nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari abibategetse.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerobowamu acurira imana Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Maze Yerobowamu yubaka igisagara c’i Shekemu co mu ntara y’imitumba ya Efurayimu, aba ari ho aba. Hanyuma avayo, yubaka igisagara c’i Peniyeli.<verse eid="1KI 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Yerobowamu yibwira mu mutima ati: “Nintaba maso, ubwami burasubira mu ruvyaro rwa Dawidi. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Aba bantu nibakomeza kwama baja i Yerusalemu gushikanira ibimazi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bazohava basubira kugirana isezerano na Rehobowamu umwami w’i Buyuda, baheze banyice, hanyuma bisubirire ku mwami Rehobowamu.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Uwo mwami amaze guhanuza, aca acurisha amashuri abiri mu nzahabu. Aca abwira abantu ati: “Yemwe Bisirayeli, birabaruhishije kwama muduga i Yerusalemu. Ng’izi imana zanyu zabakuye muri Egiputa.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Imwe ayishinga i Beteli mu bumanuko, iyindi ayishinga mu buraruko, mu ntara ya Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Maze ico kintu gihindukira abantu icaha gikomeye, ku buryo hariho n’abagenda gusenga ic’i Beteli, bagaca bongera bagafata urugendo rurerure baja gusenga ico kindi c’i Dani.<verse eid="1KI 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Yerobowamu yubaka ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi, agena n’abaherezi mu miryango yose, naho bataba bava mu Balewi. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Aca ashinga ko ku musi ugira cumi na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’umunani hazohora haba muri Isirayeli umusi mukuru, kugira ngo yigane umusi mukuru w’insago wahimbazwa i Buyuda. Ivyo yabigiriye i Beteli, ashikanira ibimazi iyo shuri yacurishije. I Beteli nyene ahagena n’abaherezi bo mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo yubatse. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Ku musi ugira cumi na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’umunani, ukwezi yihitiyemwo wenyene, ashikanira ibimazi ku gicaniro yubatse i Beteli. Nuko ashinga uwo musi mukuru kubw’Abisirayeli bose, hanyuma yurira ku gicaniro gutanga ibimazi.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Uwavugishwa n’Imana yava i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Umuntu w’Imana ava i Buyuda aja i Beteli atumwe n’Imana, ashika igihe Yerobowamu yari ahagaze imbere y’igicaniro i Beteli agira atange ibimazi. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Aca arasemerera uko abwiwe n’Imana, abwira ico gicaniro ati: “Wa gicaniro we, ewe wa gicaniro! Nguku uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Mu muryango wa Dawidi hazovuka umuhungu yitwa Yosiya. Kuri wewe ni ho azokererera abaherezi b’ibigirwamana vyo mu mataba y’imisozi baza kugutangirako ibimazi, kandi kuri wewe ni ho bazoturirira amagufa y’abantu.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Uwo musi nyene, uwo muntu w’Imana aca atanga ikimenyetso co kwemeza ivyo avuze, ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atanze iki kimenyetso: Iki gicaniro kigira gisadukemwo kubiri, iminyota yose yari kuri co iseseke hasi.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Umwami Yerobowamu yumvise ivyo uwo muntu w’Imana asemereye abwira ico gicaniro c’i Beteli, aramvura ukuboko amutunga urutoke, ahagaze i ruhande ya ca gicaniro, avuga ati: “Mufate!” Kwa kuboko amutumberejeko guca kuradadarara ntivyakunda ko asubira kukwigarukanako. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Ca gicaniro gica gisadukamwo kubiri, iminyota yose yari kuri co iseseka hasi nk’uko wa muntu w’Imana yari yabivugishijwe n’ijambo rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1KI 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Umwami aca abarira wa muntu w’Imana ati: “Ndagusavye nyingingira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe, ukuboko kwanje gusubire kumere uko kwahora.” Wa muntu w’Imana yinginga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kwa kuboko kw’Umwami gusubira kumera neza.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Umwami aca abarira uwo muntu w’Imana ati: “Ingo tujane iwanje, ndakuzimane, kandi ndaguhe n’ingabire.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Wa muntu w’Imana aramwishura ati: “N’aho wombwira ko umpa igice c’ivyo utunze vyose, sinojana nawe, kandi sinogira ico ndira canke nywera ngaha. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Kuko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryantegetse riti: ‘Ntihaze hagire ico urya canke unywa, kandi ntuzogarukane inzira wajanye.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Nuko aca afata iyindi nzira, ntiyasubira inyuma aciye mu nzira yazananye aje i Beteli.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Igihe ivyo vyaba, hariho umuvugishwa n’Imana wa kera yaba i Beteli, abahungu biwe batashe bamubwira ivyo uwo muntu w’Imana yakoreye i Beteli uwo musi, bongera bamubwira n’ivyo yabariye umwami. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Se arababaza ati: “Mu gusubira inyuma yajanye inzira iyihe?” Na bo barayimwereka. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Aca abarira abo bahungu biwe ati: “Nimuntegurire indogoba.” Barayimutegurira, na we ayicarako, <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />akurikira uwo muntu w’Imana, amusanga yicaye musi y’igiti c’umwelayo, aramubaza ati: “Ni wewe muntu w’Imana wavuye i Buyuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Na we arishura ati: “Ni jewe.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Wa muvugishwa aramubwira ati: “Ingo dutahane i muhira ndakuzimane.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Wa muntu w’Imana aramwishura ati: “Sinshobora gusubira inyuma ngo njane nawe, kandi sinshobora kugira ico ndya canke nywa aha hantu, <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />kuko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryambariye riti: ‘Ntihazogire ico urya canke unywa, kandi ntuzoce mu nzira wajanye mu gusubira inyuma.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Wa muvugishwa wa kera aramubarira ati: “Nanje ndi umuvugishwa n’Imana nkawe. Kandi umumarayika yampaye ijambo rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rivuga riti: ‘Genda umugarukane i muhira iwawe, afungure yongere anywe amazi.’ ” Ariko yariko aramubesha. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Wa muntu w’Imana aca asubirana inyuma na we, arira mu nzu y’uwo muvugishwa, yongera anywaho n’amazi.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Bacicaye ku meza, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri wa muvugishwa wa kera yagarukanye wa muntu w’Imana. <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Arasemerera abarira wa muntu w’Imana yavuye i Buyuda ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Wahinduye ubusa ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntiwakurikije itegeko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe yaguhaye. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Wasubiye inyuma, urira kandi unywera mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakubujije kuriramwo no kunyweramwo. None rero umuvyimba wawe ntuzohambwa mu mva ya ba sogokuruza bawe.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Wa muntu w’Imana ahejeje kurya no kunywa, wa muvugishwa aca amutegurira indogoba, <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />wa muntu w’Imana aca asubira gufata urugendo. Ariko akiri mu nzira, ahura n’intare, iramwica. Umuvyimba wiwe uca uguma urambitse ku nzira, ya ndogoba na ya ntare biguma bihagaze i ruhande yawo. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Abantu barengana babonye uwo muvyimba uryamye hasi, bakabona na ya ntare ihagaze i ruhande yawo, baca baja kubivuga muri ca gisagara wa muvugishwa wa kera yabamwo.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Wa muvugishwa yari yamugarukanye avyumvise, aravuga ati: “Uwo ni wa muntu w’Imana yahindura ubusa ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamurekuriyeko intambwe iramwica nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryamuburiye.”<verse eid="1KI 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Uwo muvugishwa aca abwira abahungu biwe ati: “Ntegurire indogoba.” Na bo barayimutegurira. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Nuko aragenda asanga wa muvyimba urambaraye hasi, na ya ndogoba n’intare bihagaze i ruhande yawo. Iyo ntare ntiyari yariye uwo muvyimba, nta n’ico yagize iyo ndogoba. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Wa muvugishwa aca afata wa muvyimba wa wa muntu w’Imana, awushira ku ndogoba, awuzana mu gisagara c’i Beteli, kugira ngo amugandarire, hanyuma amuhambe. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Nuko aryamika ico kiziga mu mva yiwe, amuborogera cane avuga ati: “Yo, muvukanyi!”<verse eid="1KI 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Ahejeje kumuhamba, abarira abahungu biwe ati: “Ninapfa, muzompambe mu mva urya muntu w’Imana yahambwemwo, amagufa yanje muzoyaryamike i ruhande y’ayiwe. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Kuko ijambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamubwiye ngo avugire ku gicaniro i Beteli no mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi mu bisagara vy’i Samariya nta nkeka rizoshika.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Ariko n’inyuma y’ivyo, Yerobowamu ntiyahevye inzira ziwe mbi, ahubwo yasubijeho abaherezi ku mitumba, bava mu bantu abo ari bo bose. Hagize uwumva ashaka kuba umuherezi wese yaca amurobanura, akaba umuherezi muri ivyo bibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Ico cabereye umuryango wa Yerobowamu icaha kinini, catumye ingoma yiwe isenyuka, irazimangana kw’isi.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ahiya avugishwa kuri Yerobowamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Ico gihe Abiya umuhungu wa Yerobowamu aragwara cane. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Yerobowamu abarira umugore wiwe ati: “Niwiyoberanye kugira ngo ntihagire uwumenya ko uri umwamikazi, uheze uje i Shilo ku muvugishwa Ahiya abayo, umwe yambwira ko nzoba umwami. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Ujane amarobe cumi y’imitsima n’udukate, utware n’agakarabo k’umutsama w’ubuki, uje kumuraba, umubaze ibizoshikira uwu umuhungu.” <verse eid="1KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Nuko umugore wa Yerobowamu abigenza nk’uko yabimubwiye, aja kwa Ahiya i Shilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:4">Ico gihe Ahiya ntiyari akibona neza kuko yari ashaje cane. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabariye Ahiya ati: “Umugore wa Yerobowamu araja kuza kukubaza ivy’umuhungu wiwe, kuko agwaye cane. Uze kumubwira uko nza kukubwira. Aja kuza yiyoberanije, yigize uwundi mugore.”<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Ahiya yumvise ibirenge vyiwe acinjira mu muryango, aca avuga ati: “Shika, yewe mugore wa Yerobowamu! Ni kubera iki wiyoberanije, ukigira uwundi mugore?” Yongera amubwira ati: “Ndagufitiye inkuru mbi. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Genda ubarire Yerobowamu uti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze ati: Nagukuye mu bandi bantu basanzwe ndagushira hejuru, ndaguha kuganza ubwoko bwanje bwa Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Nasambuye ubwami ndabwaka uruvyaro rwa Dawidi ndabuha wewe, ariko ntiwambera umusavyi mwiza nka Dawidi, yubahirije amabwirizwa yanje, ankurikira n’umutima wiwe wose, akora ibibereye mu nyonga zanje. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Wakoze ibibi birushirije ivy’abandi babayeho imbere yawe. Wicuriye ibigirwamana mu vyuma, untera uburake, unshiburira inyuma yawe.<verse eid="1KI 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />None rero nzoteza ivyago umuryango wa Yerobowamu, nice abahungu bawe ndabaherengeteze muri Isirayeli, baba abagurano canke abidegemvya. Nzotongora umuryango wa Yerobowamu nk’uwuturira umwanda akawumara. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Abo mu muryango wa Yerobowamu bazogwa mu gisagara bazoribwa n’imbwa; abazogwa mu gahinga bazoribwa n’ibisiga vyo mu kirere. Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Yongera abwira muka Yerobowamu ati: “Nayo wewe, subira inyuma, niwamara guhonyoza ikirenge mu gisagara cawe, umuhungu wawe aca acikana. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Abisirayeli bose bazomugandarira hanyuma bamuhambe. Ni we mwana wa Yerobowamu wenyene azohambwa, kuko mu ruvyaro rwa Yerobowamu uwo ari we wenyene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli yagize iciza amubonako.<verse eid="1KI 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwihagurukiriza umwami muri Isirayeli azohonya umuryango wa Yerobowamu. Ivyo bigiye kuba vuba, kandi birashitse! <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Ikindi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agiye gukubita Isirayeli, imere nk’irenga rikubebwa n’amazi. Azorandura Abisirayeli abakure mu gihugu ciza yahaye ba sekuruza, abashwiragirize hakurya y’uruzi Efurate, kuko bateye uburake <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu gushinga inkingi za Ashera. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Kandi azota Isirayeli kubera ivyaha Yerobowamu yakoze, n’ivyo yakoresheje Abisirayeli.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Muka Yerobowamu aca arahaguruka aragenda, aja i Tiriza. Acinjira mu muryango w’ingoro, wa mwana aca aracikana. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Nuko baramuhamba, Abisirayeli bose baramugandarira, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabivugishije umusavyi wiwe, umuvugishwa Ahiya.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yerobowamu, ivy’intambara yagwanye, n’ukuntu yatwaye, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yerobowamu yatwaye Isirayeli imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri, hanyuma ahamvya ba sekuruza. Umuhungu wiwe Nadabu ni we yamusubiriye ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Rehobowamu umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Rehobowamu mwene Salomo yari umwami w’i Buyuda. Yari afise imyaka mirongo ine n’umwe igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, hanyuma atwara imyaka cumi n’indwi, aba i Yerusalemu, igisagara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaratoranije mu miryango yose y’Abisirayeli ngo ahashire izina ryiwe. Nyina yitwa Nayama; yari Umwamonikazi.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Mu gihe Rehobowamu yari ku ngoma, Abayuda bakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, bamutera ishavu gusumba uko ba sekuruza babikoze, <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />kuko biyubakiye ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi no musi y’ibiti bitotahaye, bakahashinga inkingi z’amabuye n’inkingi za Ashera. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Muri iyo ntara hariho n’abagabo n’abagore b’abamaraya mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo. Abantu badukana ingeso z’abanyamahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yirukanye muri ico gihugu imbere y’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Mu mwaka ugira gatanu Rehobowamu ari ku ngoma, Shishaki umwami wa Egiputa, atera Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Asahura ubutunzi bwose bwari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ubwari mu ngoro y’umwami. Atwara ibintu vyose, harimwo na za nkinzo z’inzahabu Salomo yari yaracurishije. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Nuko umwami Rehobowamu aca acurisha izindi nkinzo mu butare bw’umwakaka asubiriza zimwe za mbere, aca azizeza intwazangabo z’abacungera ku kirimba c’ingoro y’umwami. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Igihe cose umwami yagomba kwinjira mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, abacungera ku kirimba baca bajana na we bitwaje za nkinzo, mu nyuma bagaheza bakazisubiza mu cumba cazo.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Rehobowamu hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyose, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’Ivyabaye ku bami b’i Buyuda? <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Hama hari intambara z’urutavanako hagati ya Rehobowamu na Yerobowamu. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Rehobowamu arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa hamwe na bo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Nyina wiwe yitwa Nayama, yari Umwamonikazi. Umuhungu wiwe Abiya amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Abiya, umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani Yerobowamu mwene Nebati ari ku ngoma, ni ho Abiya yaba umwami w’i Buyuda, <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />maze aganza imyaka itatu aba i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Mayaka, umukobwa wa Abishalomu.<verse eid="1KI 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Yakoze ivyaha nk’ivyo se yakoze imbere yiwe, kandi umutima wiwe ntiwari ugororokeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe na mba, nk’uko sekuruza Dawidi yari ameze. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Ariko ku bwa Dawidi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe areka uruvyaro rwiwe ruguma ku ngoma, kugira ngo itara ryiwe ntirizime kandi kugira ngo Yerusalemu hazigamwe. Ni ko kumuhagurukiriza umwuzukuruza yitwa Abiya, yicara ku ngoma i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Dawidi yari yakoze ibibereye mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntiyatirimuka ku mabwirizwa yiwe ubuzima bwiwe bwose, kiretse ivyo yakoreye Uriya Umuheti.<verse eid="1KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Kandi ku ngoma ya Abiya, hagumye intambara hagati yiwe na Yerobowamu. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Ibindi bijanye n’ivyabaye ku ngoma ya Abiya hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyose vyanditse mu gitabu c’Ivyabaye ku bami b’i Buyuda. Hagumye intambara hagati ya Abiya na Yerobowamu. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Hanyuma Abiya arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Asa amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Asa, umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri Yerobowamu ari ku ngoma ya Isirayeli, Asa ni ho yaba umwami w’i Buyuda, <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />amara imyaka mirongo ine n’umwe aba i Yerusalemu. Inakuru yari Mayaka umukobwa wa Abishalomu.<verse eid="1KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Asa akora ibibereye mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’uko sekuruza Dawidi yakoze. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Akura mu gihugu ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vy’abagabo n’abagore b’abamaraya, akuraho n’ibigirwamana ba sekuruza bashizeho. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Mbere yirukana inakuru Mayaka amwaka iteka ryo kuba nyina w’umwami, kuko yari yaracurishije igishushanyo c’ubuyobe ca Ashera. Asa atemagura ico kigirwamana, agituririra ku mwonga Kidironi. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Naho Asa atashoboye gukuraho ibibanza basengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi, yari yareguriye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> umutima wiwe wose imisi yose y’ukubaho kwiwe. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Yinjiza mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ifeza n’inzahabu n’ibikoresho we na se bari bareguriye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Hama hari intambara hagati ya Asa na Bayasha umwami wa Isirayeli igihe cose bamaze bari ku ngoma. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Bayasha umwami wa Isirayeli aduga gutera i Buyuda, yubaka uruzitiro rukikuje i Rama kugira ngo abuze umuntu wese yogomba kuja canke kuva kwa Asa umwami w’i Buyuda.<verse eid="1KI 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Maze Asa afata ifeza n’inzahabu zose zari zasigaye mu bubiko bwo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no mu ngoro yiwe, azirungikana abatware, abatuma kwa Beni-Hadadi umwami w’i Siriya, yatwarira i Damasiko. Beni-Hadadi yari mwene Taburimoni, Taburimoni mwene Heziyoni. Nuko abarungikana n’ubutumwa buvuga ngo: <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Tugiriranire isezerano hagati yanje nawe, nk’uko vyari biri hagati ya data na so. Raba, ndakurungikiye ifeza n’inzahabu. None rero nureke isezerano rya mwe na Bayasha umwami wa Isirayeli kugira ngo asubire inyuma areke kuntera.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Beni-Hadadi yemeranya n’umwami Asa, arungika intwazangabo ziwe gutera ibisagara vya Isirayeli, bafata Iyoni, Dani, Abeli-Beti-Mayaka, bafata Kinereti hose hamwe n’intara ya Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Bayasha avyumvise, aca areka kwubaka i Rama, asubira i Tiriza. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Maze umwami Asa ategeka abantu b’i Buyuda bose ata n’umwe avuyemwo, bakurayo amabuye n’imbaho zose Bayasha yariko arakoresha. Asa aca abikoresha mu kuzitira ibisagara vya Geba mu ntara ya Benyamini hamwe n’igisagara ca Misipa.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Asa, ivy’ubutwari bwiwe, ivyo yakoze, n’ivy’ibisagara yubatse, mbega ntivyanditse mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? Asa ageze mu zabukuru, agwara ibirenge. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Hanyuma Asa arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa hamwe na bo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Yehoshafati amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Nadabu, umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Nadabu mwene Yerobowamu yabaye umwami wa Isirayeli mu mwaka ugira kabiri Asa ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, aganza Isirayeli imyaka ibiri. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, agendera mu ngeso za se no mu vyaha yakora, atuma n’Abisirayeli babikora.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Bayasha mwene Ahiya wo mu muryango wa Isakari, ategura umugambi wo kwica umwami. Igihe Nadabu n’ingabo za Isirayeli bari bateye igisagara ca Gibetoni caganzwa n’Abafilisitiya, Bayasha yica umwami Nadabu. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Bayasha yishe Nadabu mu mwaka ugira gatatu Asa ari ku ngoma y’i Buyuda. Bayasha aca aba umwami, asubirira Nadabu.<verse eid="1KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Agishika ku ngoma, yica umuryango wose wa Yerobowamu. Mu muryango wa Yerobowamu, nta n’umwe yasigaye, yarabatikije bose, nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryabivuze aciye ku musavyi wiwe Ahiya w’i Shilo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Ivyo vyabaye kuko Yerobowamu yari yakoze ivyaha vyinshi, atuma n’Abisirayeli babikora, ari co catumye uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli bumuziriringira.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Nadabu hamwe n’ivyo yakoze, vyanditse mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Hama hari intambara hagati ya Asa na Bayasha umwami wa Isirayeli igihe cose bamaze bari ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Bayasha umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Mu mwaka ugira gatatu Asa ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, Bayasha mwene Ahiya ni ho yaba umwami w’Abisirayeli bose. Yaba i Tiriza, aganza Isirayeli imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ine. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, agendera mu ngeso za se no mu vyaha yakora, atuma n’Abisirayeli na bo babikora.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Maze Ijambo rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rishikirizwa Bayasha riciye ku wavugishwa n’Imana Yehu mwene Hanani, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />rivuga riti: “Naguhagurukije ndagukuye mu mukungungu, ndakugira umutware w’ubwoko bwanje bwa Isirayeli, ariko ugendera mu ngeso za Yerobowamu, utuma ubwoko bwanje bucumura, bituma ndabarakarira kubera ivyaha vyabo. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />None ngiye kukurandurana n’umuryango wawe, ndawugire nk’uko nagize uwa Yerobowamu mwene Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Imbwa ni zo zizorya abawe bazogwa mu gisagara, nayo abazogwa mu gahinga bazoribwa n’ibisiga vyo mu kirere.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Bayasha, ivyo yakoze n’ivyo yashitseko, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Hanyuma Bayasha ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa i Tiriza. Umuhungu wiwe Ela aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Ariko kandi, Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryarashikirijwe Bayasha n’umuryango wiwe riciye kuri wa muvugishwa Yehu mwene Hanani, kubera ibintu bibiri: ivyaha vyose yakoreye mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amurakira, amugira nk’umuryango wa Yerobowamu, hamwe rero no kuba ari we yatikije umuryango wa Yerobowamu.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Ela, umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri na gatandatu Asa umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, Ela mwene Bayasha ni ho yimikwa nk’umwami wa Isirayeli, amara imyaka ibiri aba i Tiriza.<verse eid="1KI 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Umwe mu bakuru b’abasoda yatwara ica kabiri c’imikogote y’umwami yitwa Zimuri, agira imigabo yo kwica umwami Ela. Umusi umwe, Ela yari i Tiriza, ariko anywera kwa Arusa umukuru w’ikirimba, kandi akaba yamaze kuborerwa. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Zimuri arinjira, amutsindaho, aramwica. Hari mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri n’indwi Asa umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma. Nuko Zimuri aca aramusubirira, aba umwami.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Agitangura gutwara, yicaye ku ntebe y’ubwami, yicisha umuryango wose wa Bayasha, ntiyasigaza icitwa umuhungu, haba mu ncuti canke mu bagenzi biwe. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Uko ni ko Zimuri yaranduye umuryango wa Bayasha, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabibwiye Bayasha aciye ku wavugishwa n’Imana Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Ivyo vyabaye kubera ivyaha Bayasha n’umuhungu wiwe Ela bakoze, batuma n’Abisirayeli babikora, batuma uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli buziriringa kubera ibitagira ikimazi ari vyo bigirwamana vyabo.<verse eid="1KI 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Ela hamwe n’ivyo yakoze, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Zimuri, umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri n’indwi Asa umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, Zimuri ni ho yima i Tiriza, amara imisi indwi ari ku ngoma. Ingabo za Isirayeli zari zagize igitero ku gisagara c’Abafilisitiya citwa Gibetoni. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Abasoda b’Abisirayeli bumvise ko Zimuri ari we yateguye kwica umwami hanyuma akamugandagura, baca bimika Omuri umukuru w’abasoda, aba ari we bagira umwami wa Isirayeli, uwo musi nyene, muri iyo kambi nyene. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Omuri n’abasoda b’Abisirayeli baca bava i Gibetoni batera i Tiriza barahigarurira. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Zimuri abonye ko igisagara gifashwe, aca yinjira mu munara w’ikirimba, yituririrako inzu, yicwa n’umuriro. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Ivyo vyamubayeko kuko na we nyene yakoze ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, mu kugendera mu ngeso za Yerobowamu no mu vyaha yakoze, akabikoresha n’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Zimuri n’ivy’ubugarariji yagize, vyanditse mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Omuri umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Zimuri amaze gupfa, ubwoko bwa Isirayeli buca bwigaburamwo kabiri, bamwe bakurikira Tibuni mwene Ginati ngo ababere umwami, abandi bakurikira Omuri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Ariko abayoboka Omuri bari bakomeye gusumba abayoboka Tibuni mwene Ginati. Nuko Tibuni aricwa, Omuri aca aba umwami.<verse eid="1KI 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu na rimwe Asa umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, ni ho Omuri yatangura kuganza Isirayeli, amara imyaka cumi n’ibiri yose hamwe, ariko itandatu muri yo yayimaze i Tiriza. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Hanyuma umwami Omuri agurira Shemeri umusozi witwa Samariya. Awugura italanto zibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 68.</char></note> z’ifeza, awubakako igisagara, acita Samariya, rivuye muri Shemeri, izina ry’uwo yahaguriye.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Ariko Omuri akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, akora ivyaha biruta ivy’abatwaye imbere yiwe. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Agendera mu nzira za Yerobowamu mwene Nebati no mu vyaha yakora, atuma n’Abisirayeli babikora, maze batera uburake <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli, bayirakishije ibitagira ikimazi ari vyo bigirwamana vyabo.<verse eid="1KI 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Omuri, ivyo yakoze n’ivyo yashitseko, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Nuko Omuri ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa i Samariya. Umuhungu wiwe Ahabu amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Ahabu, umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu n’umunani Asa ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, Ahabu mwene Omuri ni ho yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, amara imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri i Samariya aganza Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Ahabu mwene Omuri yakoze ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> biruta ivy’abatwaye imbere yiwe. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Mbere nk’aho womenga kugendera mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati ntivyari bimuhagije, we yararengejeko, arongora Yezebeli umukobwa wa Etibayali umwami wa Sidoni, aca atangura gukorera ikigirwamana Bayali, aba ari co asenga, <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />yubaka n’igicaniro mu ngoro y’ico kigirwamana nyene yacubakiye i Samariya. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Ahabu yongera ashinga inkingi za Ashera, akora n’ibindi vyinshi vyatumye uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, buziriringa, arusha ibibi abami bose ba Isirayeli batwaye imbere yiwe.<verse eid="1KI 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Ku ngoma ya Ahabu ni ho Hiyeli w’i Beteli yasubira kwubaka Yeriko. Agitangura kwubaka umushinge, umuhungu wiwe w’imfura Abiramu arapfa. Amaze guheza inzitiro zaco, umuhungu wiwe w’umuhererezi Segubu na we arapfa. Ivyo vyose vyabaye nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryarabivuze, riciye mu kanwa ka Yosuwa mwene Nuni.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya avugishwa ivy’uruzuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Hariho umugabo w’i Tishubi i Gileyadi yitwa Eliya, umusi umwe araza abwira Ahabu ati: “Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana nzima, Imana ya Isirayeli nkorera, ko ata rume ruzosubira gukoroka canke imvura ngo isubire kugwa muri iyi myaka, kiretse ari jewe ndabivuze.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya agaburirwa n’ibikona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Maze Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ribwira Eliya, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />riti: “Va ngaha ufate inzira ija mu buseruko, winyegeze hafi y’akuzi Keriti hakurya ya Yorodani. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Uzonywa amazi y’ako kuzi, kandi nategetse ibikona ngo bize bikugaburirireyo.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Nuko aragenda abikora nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryabimubwiye. Aja hafi y’ako kuzi Keriti, hakurya ya Yorodani, agumayo. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Ibikona bikama bimuzanira imikate n’inyama mu gatondo no ku mugoroba, akanywa amazi y’ako kuzi.<verse eid="1KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Eliya n’umupfakazi w’i Zarefati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Haciye igihe ka kuzi karakama, kuko ata mvura yari ikigwa muri ico gihugu. <verse eid="1KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ribwira Eliya riti: <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Haguruka ugende i Zarefati igisagara co mu ntara ya Sidoni ugumeyo. Nategetse umupfakazi waho kuzokwama akugaburira.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Nuko arahaguruka aja i Zarefati. Ashitse kw’irembo ry’igisagara, aca abona umupfakazi yariko arasenya inkwi. Aramuhamagara, amubwira ati: “Ndagusavye umpe utuzi two kunywa mu gikombe.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Wa mupfakazi agiye, Eliya asubira kumuhamagara, amubwira ati: “Unzanire n’agakate, uzoba ukoze.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Ndakurahiye ukubaho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe, nta mukate ngira. Aha mfise agafu gakeya gasigaye mu gaseke, n’utuvuta dukeya mu gikombe. Aha rero ndiko ndegeranya udukwi kugira ngo ducumbe twe n’umuhungu wanje, turye ubwa nyuma, hanyuma dupfe.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya aramubwira ati: “Ntutinye. Genda i muhira ukore uko ubivuze. Ariko ubanze unkorere agakate gatoya kuri ivyo ufise hanyuma ukanzanire, maze uheze urondere ivya mwe n’umuhungu wawe. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Agaseke kawe ntikazoburamwo ifu, n’igikombe cawe ntikizoburamwo amavuta, gushika aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azorungikira imvura muri iki gihugu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Nuko aragenda abikora nk’uko Eliya yabimubwiye. Eliya n’uwo muryango bagumye bafise ivyo barya ico gihe cose. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Amavuta ntiyigeze ahera muri ca gikombe, n’ifu ntiyigeze ihera muri ka gaseke, nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryabivuze riciye kuri Eliya.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Haciye igihe, umuhugu w’uwo mupfakazi aragwara. Ingwara yiwe ikomeza kwongerekana, gushika aho apfa. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Uwo mugore abarira Eliya ati: “Twapfuye iki ga muntu w’Imana? Waje kumpanira ivyaha vyanje mu kunyicira umwana?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya amwishura ati: “Nzanira uwo mwana wawe.” Aca aramwakira mu maboko yiwe, amudugana mu cumba co hejuru yabamwo, amuryamika ku buriri bwiwe. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Maze atakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yanje, ni iki gitumye utera amarushwa uwu mupfakazi yampaye indaro, mu kwica umuhungu wiwe?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Nuko amwubararako incuro zitatu, yongera atakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yanje, ndakwinginze subiza ubuzima uwu mwana!”<verse eid="1KI 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yumva ugutakamba kwa Eliya, uwo mwana arahembuka, asubira kuba muzima. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya aca aramuterura, amukura muri ico cumba, amusubiza nyina wiwe avuga ati: “Ehe raba, umuhungu wawe ni muzima!”<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Wa mugore aca abarira Eliya ati: “Noneho rero menye ko uri umuntu w’Imana, kandi ko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rica mu kanwa kawe ari iry’ukuri.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Eliya na Obadiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Haciye igihe, mu mwaka ugira gatatu w’urwo ruzuba, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Eliya, riti: “Genda wiyereke umwami Ahabu, umubwire ko ngiye kurungika imvura vuba.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Nuko Eliya aragenda yiyereka Ahabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Ico gihe inzara yari nyinshi cane i Samariya. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Ahabu atumako Obadiya, yari ajejwe ikirimba. Uwo Obadiya yari umuntu yubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> cane. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Igihe Yezebeli yariko arica abavugishwa b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Obadiya yanyegeje abavugishwa ijana mu masenga, mirongo itanu abanyegeza muri rimwe, abandi mirongo itanu mu rindi, akama abagaburirirayo, akabaherayo n’amazi yo kunywa. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Ahabu abarira Obadiya ati: “Reka tugendagende mu gihugu cose, tugenzure amariba n’ibiyaya, kumbure tworonka ahari ubwatsi bw’ifarasi n’inyumbu zacu turabe ko hari na nkeya zorokoka.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Nuko bagabura amayira, Ahabu afata inzira yiwe, Obadiya na we afata iyiwe.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Obadiya akiri ku nzira agenda, aza abona bahuye na Eliya, aramumenya, aramupfukamira, hanyuma amubaza ati: “Eliya, ni wewe ga nyakwubahwa?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliya amwishura ati: “Ni jewe. Genda ubarire shobuja uti ‘Eliya ari hano.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Ariko Obadiya aramwankira, avuga ati: “Ni ikihe kibi nagukoreye gitumye undekurira mu maboko ya Ahabu ngo anyice? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko umwami yakurondeye mu mahanga no mu bwami bwose bwo kw’isi, kuva iyo buhera n’iyo buhereza. Kandi igihe cose ihanga canke ubwami bwavuga ko atari ho uri, yarabarahiza ngo bemeze ko bakubuze koko. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />None nawe uriko urambwira ngo nje kubwira databuja ko uri ngaha? <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Mbega nova ngaha Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agaca agutwara iyo ntazi, Ahabu ashitse akakurondera akakubura, ntiyoca anyica? Ariko jewe umusavyi wawe namye nubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuva mu buto bwanje. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Mbega nyakwubahwa, nta wigeze akubwira ivyo nakoze igihe Yezebeli yariko aratikiza abavugishwa b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>? Nanyegeje abavugishwa b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ijana mu masenga abiri, mirongo itanitanu muri rimwe, ndabagaburirirayo, ndabaherayo n’amazi yo kunywa. <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />None nawe uriko urambarira ngo nje kubwira databuja ko uri ngaha? Mugenzi, yoca anyica!”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya avuga ati: “Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana nkorera, ko nza guhagarara imbere ya Ahabu uwu musi.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyabaye ku musozi Karumeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Nuko Obadiya aja kurondera Ahabu, arabimubwira. Ahabu na we aca aza guhura na Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Ahabu abonye Eliya, aramubwira ati: “Ni wewe mbonye, uteje amagorwa nk’aya Isirayeli?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eliya amwishura ati: “Nta magorwa nateye Abisirayeli. Ahubwo mwe n’umuryango wa so ni mwebwe mwayabateye. Mwataye ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mukurikira Bayali. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Koranya abantu bose bo muri Isirayeli, bansange ku musozi Karumeli. Uzane na ba bavugishwa amajana ane na mirongo itanu ba Bayali, na bamwe amajana ane ba Ashera, basangira na Yezebeli.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Nuko Ahabu atumako Abisirayeli bose hamwe n’abo bavugishwa, bahurira ku musozi Karumeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Eliya ahagarara imbere y’abantu, ababwira ati: “Mbega muzogeza ryari kuba ba nyamujiryanino? Nimba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we Mana, nabe ari we mukurikira. Kandi nimba Bayali ari yo mana, nabe ari yo mukurikira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:21">Ariko abantu ntibaronka ico basubizayo.<verse eid="1KI 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Eliya yongera ababwira ati: “Ni jewe muvugishwa w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asigaye, ariko Bayali ifise abavugishwa amajana ane na mirongo itanu. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Nimutuzanire impfizi zibiri hano. Abavugishwa ba Bayali bitoreremwo iyo bashaka, bayibage, bayigereke ku nkwi, ariko ntibadomeke umuriro. Nanje ndabaga iyisigaye, ndayishire ku nkwi, kandi sindomeka umuriro. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Maze muheze mwambaze imana yanyu, nanje ndambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje. Imana iza kurungika umuriro, ni yo izoba ari Imana y’ukuri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Bose bishurira rimwe bati: “Ivyo uvuze ni vyiza.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Eliya araheza abarira abavugishwa ba Bayali ati: “Hitamwo impfizi imwe mubanze muyitegure kuko ari mwebwe muri benshi. Muheze muhamagare imana yanyu, ariko ntimudomeke umuriro.” <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Nuko bafata impfizi bari hamwe, barayibaga. Baca bahamagara Bayali kuva mu gatondo, bamara umurango wose basemerera, bavuga bati: “Ewe Bayali, nutwumvire, utwishure!” Ariko ntibigera baronka inyishu mu buryo na bumwe. Batangura gutambatamba bazunguruka ico gicaniro bubatse aho hantu.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Hageze nk’isaha zitandatu, Eliya atangura kubashimanga ababwira ati: “Nimusemerere cane! Erega ni imana! Kumbure iri mu vyiyumviro vyinshi, canke ifise akazi kenshi, canke yagiye gutembera. Canke na ho, irasinziriye, ikeneye uwuyivyura.” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Nuko barushirizaho gukoma induru, bikebaguza inkota n’amacumu nk’uko vyari mu migenzo yabo, gushika aho imibiri yabo itemba amaraso. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Isaha zitandatu zirarenga, batangura kwivugisha ibitaja ntibize, gushika igihe co gutanga ibimazi vyo ku mugoroba. Ariko ntibigera bishurwa, canke ngo hagire n’akantu na gatoya kaba.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Eliya aca abwira abantu ati: “Nimwegere hano mwese!” Baramwegera, na we asanura igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> cari carasenyutse. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Afata amabuye cumi n’abiri, nk’uko imiryango ya bene Yakobo ingana, ari we ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryabwiye riti: “Kuva ubu, uzokwitwa Isirayeli.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Ayo mabuye ayubakisha igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yimba umuvo ugikikuje, uwo muvo washobora kwuzuzwa n’ingero seya zibiri z’imbuto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 11.</char></note> <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Ashira inkwi ku gicaniro, abaga ya mpfizi, agereka inyama zayo kuri za nkwi. Aca avuga ati: “Nimwuzuze amazi imibindi minini ine, muheze muyasuke kuri ico kimazi n’izo nkwi.”<verse eid="1KI 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Ababwira ati: “Nimusukeko ayandi.” Barasubira basukako ayandi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:34">Yongera kubabwira ati: “Nimusukeko n’irya gatatu.” Na bo basukako ayandi irya gatatu. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Ya mazi araseseka ku mpande zose z’igicaniro, gushika aho na wa muvo wuzura.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Igihe co gushikana ibimazi kigeze, Eliya yegera igicaniro, asenga avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana ya Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, uwu musi bigaragare ko ari wewe Mana ya Isirayeli, kandi ko ndi umusavyi wawe, ko nakoze ibi vyose kuko ari wewe wabintumye. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, unyishure. Unyishure kugira ngo aba bantu bamenye ko wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari wewe Mana y’ukuri, kandi ko ari wewe usubiriye kwigarurirako imitima yabo.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Ubwo nyene umuriro w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uca urakoroka uvuye mw’ijuru, utongora ca kimazi, uturira za nkwi na ya mabuye, mbere ukamya na ya mazi yari yuzuye umuvo.<verse eid="1KI 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Abantu bose babibonye bikubita hasi bubamye, bavuga bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we Mana! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we Mana!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Eliya aca atanga itegeko ati: “Nimufate abavugishwa ba Bayali bose, ntihagire n’umwe abaca mu myanya y’intoke!” Nuko barabafata bose, Eliya ababwira ko babajana mu kiyaya ca Kishoni, barabajana, abicirayo.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Eliya abarira Ahabu ati: “Genda ufungure, unywe, kuko ndumva ko imvura nyishi iriko irasuma.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Nuko Ahabu aragenda, arafungura, aranywa. Ariko Eliya aduga hejuru ku musozi Karumeli, arapfukama, acurika umutwe mu maguru, arasenga.<verse eid="1KI 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Abarira umukozi wiwe ati: “Genda utereze amaso hejuru y’ikiyaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Wa mukozi aragenda, araraba, aragaruka abarira Eliya ati: “Nta co mbonye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Eliya amurungika kuraba incuro indwi.<verse eid="1KI 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Ku ncuro igira indwi, wa mukozi wiwe amubwira ati: “Mbonye agacu gatoya kangana n’ikiganza c’umuntu, kaduga kava ku kiyaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Eliya aca amubwira ati: “Irukanga ubwire Ahabu uti: ‘Urira umukogote wawe usubire i muhira imvura itarakubuza gutaha!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Muri ako kanya nyene ikirere gitangura kwirabura kubera ibicu, umuyaga urahuhuta, haza imvura y’isegenya. Ahabu aca yirukanga aja i Yezireyeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Ububasha bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buza kuri Eliya, akenyeza umukanda umutamana wiwe, yiruka imbere ya Ahabu gushika kw’Irembo rya Yezireyeli.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya ahungira i Horebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Maze Ahabu adondera Yezebeli ivyo Eliya yakoze vyose, kandi ko yicishije inkota abavugishwa ba Bayali bose. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Yezebeli aca arungika intumwa kuri Eliya kumubwira iti: “Imana zimpane, kandi zize zimpane birushirije cane, ejo umusi niwashika aha uwu ushitse ntarakugira nk’uko wagize abo bavugishwa bandi.”<verse eid="1KI 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eliya aca aterwa n’ubwoba, aca arahunga kugira ngo akize amagara yiwe. Ageze i Berisheba mu Buyuda, ahasiga wa mukozi wiwe. <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Afata urugendo wenyene aja mu bugaragwa, amara umusi wose agenda. Arahava ashikira igiti c’umurotemu, yicara mu gitutu caco, yisabira gupfa ati: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ibi biramaze. Ndeka mpfe, sinsumba ba sogokuruza.” <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Aca aryama musi y’ico giti, arasinzira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:5">Ariko agisinzira, haza umumarayika aramukoma, amubwira ati: “Vyuka urye.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Yikanguye abona umutsima ugeretse ku makara yaka, hamwe n’agakarabo k’amazi. Ararya, anywa n’ayo mazi, aca arasubira ariryamira.<verse eid="1KI 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Wa mumarayika aragaruka irya kabiri, aramukoma, amubwira ati: “Vyuka urye, unywe, kuko urugendo ruri imbere yawe ari rurerure cane.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Arikangura, ararya, anywa n’amazi. Ivyo vyokurya bimuha inkomezi amara imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine agenda, gushika ashike ku musozi Horebu, ari wo musozi w’Imana.<verse eid="1KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yiyereka Eliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Ashitseyo, yinjira mw’isenga ararayo. Hanyuma Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimubaza riti: “Eliya, aho uhakora iki?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Na we arishura ati: “Nagiriye ishaka ryinshi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose. Ariko Abisirayeli bataye isezerano, basenyagura ibicaniro vyawe, baranduza inkota abavugishwa bawe. Ni jewe jenyene nari nsigaye, none na jewe bariko barandondera ngo banyice.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amubwira ati: “Sohoka uje guhagarara imbere yanje ku musozi, kuko ngira ndahace.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:11">Maze Eliya ahagaze ngaho, haza umuyaga w’igihuhusi ukomeye cane, usatura imisozi, umenagura n’ibitandara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyari muri uwo muyaga. Inyuma yawo haza nyamugigima, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyari muri yo. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Inyuma ya nyamugigima haza umuriro, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyari muri uwo muriro. Inyuma y’uwo muriro haza agacere, humvikana ikimeze nk’akajwi gatoya kongorera. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Eliya akumvise yiyambura umutamana awitwikira mu maso, aca ariruka ahagarara ku rwinjiriro rw’iryo senga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:13">Aca yumva ijwi rimubaza riti: “Eliya, aha uhakora iki?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Na we arishura ati: “Nagiriye ishaka ryinshi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose. Ariko Abisirayeli bataye isezerano, basenyagura ibicaniro vyawe, baranduza inkota abavugishwa bawe. Ni jewe jenyene nari nsigaye, none na jewe bariko barandondera ngo banyice.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati: “Fata inzira wazananye, usubire inyuma, uje mu bugaragwa bw’i Damasiko. Niwashikayo, uzorobanuze amavuta Hazayeli, abe umwami w’i Siriya. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Wongere urobanure Yehu mwene Nimushi, abe umwami wa Isirayeli, urobanure na Elisa mwene Shafati w’i Abeli-Mehola, abe ari we azogusubirira mu buvugishwa. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Uwuzokira inkota ya Hazayeli, azokwica na Yehu; uwuzokira inkota ya Yehu, azokwica abazocika na Elisa. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Ariko rero nariziganirije abantu ibihumbi indwi muri Isirayeli batigeze bapfukamira Bayali, canke ngo bayisome.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihamagarwa rya Elisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Nuko Eliya ava aho aragenda, abona Elisa mwene Shafati ariko ararimisha inka cumi na zibiri, zifatanijwe n’ingogo ari zibirizibiri, na we ari imbere yazo. Eliya aramwegera amutererako umutamana wiwe ku bitugu, hanyuma arigira. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Elisa aca asiga ngaho za nka ziwe zirima, akurikira Eliya. Amubwira ati: “Reka nje gusezera data na mama, mpeze nze tujane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Eliya aramubwira ati: “Genda, ariko wibuke ico nagukoreye.”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Elisa aca ava inyuma yiwe, asubira inyuma. Afata inka zibiri zifatanijwe n’ingogo, arazibaga. Avunagura ingogo, azicanisha umuriro, ateka za nyama, azigaburira abantu, barazirya. Aca avaho akurikira Eliya, aba umukozi wiwe.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Beni-Hadadi atera i Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Ico gihe Beni-Hadadi umwami w’i Siriya akoranya abasoda biwe bose, aduga aherekejwe n’abami mirongo itatu na babiri bari ku mafarasi n’imikogote yabo, bakikuza Samariya, barahatera. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Beni-Hadadi arungika intumwa mu gisagara ca Ahabu umwami wa Isirayeli ati: “Beni-Hadadi avuze ati: <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Inzahabu n’ifeza ufise vyose ni ivyanje, co kimwe n’abagore bawe n’abana bawe!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Umwami wa Isirayeli yishura ati: “Nibibe nk’uko ubivuze, mwami wanje. Na jewe ubwanje hamwe n’ivyanje vyose, turi abawe.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Za ntumwa zisubira kuja kwa Ahabu zimubwira ziti: “Beni-Hadadi avuze ati: ‘Nagutumyeko intumwa kugira ngo umpe ifeza n’inzahabu vyawe, hamwe n’abagore bawe n’abana bawe. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Ariko ejo, umusi niwagera aha uwu ugeze, nzorungika abantu banje, basake ikirimba cawe hamwe n’amazu y’abatware bawe. Ic’agaciro cose bazosangayo, bazogitwara.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Umwami wa Isirayeli aca ahamagaza abatware ba Isirayeli bose, ababwira ati: “Murabona ingene uwu mugabo agomba gukwega intambara! Igihe yansaba abagore n’abana banje, inzahabu n’ifeza, sinabimwimye.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Ba batware bamubwira bati: “Ntihagire ikintu na kimwe usubira kumwemerera.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Ahabu yishura za ntumwa za Beni-Hadadi ati: “Gende mubwire umwami databuja muti: ‘Umusavyi wawe azotanga ivyo wamusavye ubwa mbere, ariko ivyo usavye ubu nta vyo yemeye.’ ” Nuko basubira inyuma bashikiriza inyishu Beni-Hadadi.<verse eid="1KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Na we asubira kurungika intumwa ati: “Imana zibimpanire, ndetse birushirije, i Samariya nihasigara n’agakungugu kokwuzura ibiganza vy’abasoda banje.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Umwami wa Isirayeli abishura ati: “Genda mumubwire muti: ‘Uwambara ibigwanisho agiye ku rugamba ntakirate nk’uwuvyambura arunesheje.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Beni-Hadadi yumvise iyo nyishu ari kumwe n’abandi bami bariko banywera mu mahema yabo, aca atanga itegeko ati: “Nimwitegure tugire igitero!” Nuko baca baritegura ngo batere igisagara.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahabu anesha Beni-Hadadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Muri ico gihe nyene, umuvugishwa aza aho Ahabu umwami wa Isirayeli ari, amubwira ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Wabonye ko izo ngabo zigukikuje ari nyishi? Uwu musi ndabarekurira mu maboko yawe, ni ho uza kumenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ahabu aramubaza ati: “None azokoresha nde?” Wa muvugishwa aramwishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Ni abasoda b’imikangara bagabwa n’abakuru b’intara.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Ahabu yongera kumubaza ati: “None ni nde azotangura gutera?” Wa muvugishwa na we ati: “Wewe.”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Ahabu aca akoranya imikangara yose igabwa n’abatware b’intara, bari amajana abiri na mirongo itatu na babiri. Akoranya n’abandi basoda b’Abisirayeli, bose hamwe bari ibihumbi indwi. <verse eid="1KI 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Nk’igihe c’isaha zitandatu, Beni-Hadadi na ba bami mirongo itatu na babiri bari bifatanije na we bakiriko baranywa bibereye mu mahema yabo, <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />ya mikangara irasohoka iva mu gisagara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:17">Begereje, abareretsi ba Beni-Hadadi baraza bamubwira bati: “Hari igitero c’abasoda baje bava i Samariya.”<verse eid="1KI 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Beni-Hadadi aca abategeka ati: “Baje gusaba amahoro canke baje kugwana, uko baza kwose mubafate ari bazima.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Ya mikangara n’abakuru b’intara barasohoka bava mu gisagara n’abandi basoda inyuma yabo, baja kugwana. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Umwisirayeli wese yica uwo bagwana, maze abasoda bose ba Siriya bacika ivutu, bakura hasi barahunga, Abisirayeli barabakinagiza. Beni-Hadadi umwami w’i Siriya ari kumwe n’abandi bakeya, burira ku mafarasi barahunga. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Ariko umwami wa Isirayeli akurikira abasigaye, arabica, atikiza amafarasi n’imikogote yabo, haba agatikizo gakomeye ku ruhande rwa Aramu.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Haciye igihe, wa muvugishwa yongera kuza ku mwami wa Isirayeli, amubwira ati: “Tegura neza igisoda cawe, wongere ugire integuro nziza y’intambara, kuko imvura niyacika, umwami wa Siriya azosubira kugutera.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Maze abasoda b’umwami wa Siriya bamuhanura bati: “Imana z’Abisirayeli, ni imana zo ku mitumba. Ni co gituma batunesheje. Nitwabagwaniriza mu biyaya, nta kabuza tuzobatsinda. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Ubu ico ukwiye gukora ni iki: kura abami bose mu mabanga yo kurongora abasoda, uhashire intwazangabo. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Wongere ukoranye abasoda bangana na barya wabuze, hamwe n’amafarasi n’imikogote bingana na birya wabuze, maze duheze tuje kubagwaniriza mu biyaya. Nta kabuza, tuzobanesha.” Umwami Beni-Hadadi yemeranya na bo, abigenza uko bamuhanuye.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Ku gacikamvura gakurikira, Beni-Hadadi yegeranya abasoda b’Abasiriya, aduga muri Efeki kugwanya Abisirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Abasoda b’Abisirayeli na bo bari bakoranye, biteguye bikwiye, baja kubagwanya.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Wa muntu w’Imana araza abarira umwami wa Isirayeli ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Kubera Abasiriya bibaza ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari imana yo ku mitumba atari iyo mu biyaya, nzorekurira mu maboko yawe izo ngabo nyinshi gutyo, kugira ngo umenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Bamara imisi indwi bari mu makambi yabo bahanganye, maze ku musi ugira indwi batana mu mitwe. Abisirayeli bica abasoda ibihumbi ijana b’Abasiriya bagwanira ku maguru. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Abasigaye bahungira mu gisagara ca Efeki, ariko uruzitiro rw’igisagara ruhenukira ku bihumbi mirongo ibiri n’indwi muri bo. Beni-Hadadi ahungira mu gisagara, yinyegeza mu cumba c’imbere.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Abatware biwe baramubwira bati: “Twarumvise ko abami b’Abisirayeli ari abanyembabazi. Reka tuje ku mwami wa Isirayeli dukenyeye amagunira, twihambiriye imikanda mw’izosi. Kumbure umwami Ahabu yokugirira imbabazi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Nuko bakenyera amagunira, bihambira imikanda mw’izosi, baja ku mwami wa Isirayeli bamubwira bati: “Umusavyi wawe Beni-Hadadi avuze ati: ‘Ndakwinginze ungirire imbabazi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Umwami wa Isirayeli yishura ati: “Aracariho? Ni umuvukanyi wanje!”<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Abo bantu bavyumvise bibatera ivyizigiro. Bishura bati: “Egome cane, Beni-Hadadi umuvukanyi wawe aracariho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Umwami ababwira ati: “Genda mumuzane!” Beni-Hadadi arasohoka, Ahabu na we amwuriza mu mukogote wiwe.<verse eid="1KI 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Beni-Hadadi abwira Ahabu ati: “Nzogusubiza ibisagara vyose data yanyaze so, kugira ngo nawe wiyubakire isoko i Damasiko nk’uko data na we yaryubatse i Samariya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Ahabu na we amubwira ati: “Niwansezeranira ivyo, nanje ndakureka wigire amahoro.” Nuko bagiranira iryo sezerano, hanyuma aramureka arigira.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuvugishwa ahambarira Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Ico gihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ategeka umwe mu bavugishwa kubwira mugenziwe ati: “Nkubita n’ico kigwanisho cawe!” Ariko uwo muntu yanka kukimukubita.<verse eid="1KI 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Wa muvugishwa aca abwira mugenziwe ati: “Ko utumviye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aho uvira ngaha intare iraza kukurya.” Wa muntu amaze kuva ngaho akagenda, intare iramutera, iramurya.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Wa muvugishwa aja kubwira uwundi mugabo ati: “Nkubita!” Wa muntu aramukubita, aramukomeretsa. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Wa muvugishwa arahaguruka, aja guhagarara ku nzira arindiriye umwami, yitwikirije igitambara mu maso kugira ngo yiyoberanye. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Umwami ahaciye, wa muvugishwa aca arasemerera ati: “Mwami wanje, jewe umusavyi wawe nari ku rugamba, hanyuma umwe mu basoda anzanira imbohe, ambwira ati: ‘Uyigumye, kandi ikagutorokana urapfa canke utange italanto imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 34.</char></note> y’ifeza.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Ariko ndavye hirya gato, ya mbohe irantorokana iragenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Umwami wa Isirayeli ati: “Urubanza ruragutsinze, kandi ni wewe nyene urwiciriye.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Ubwo nyene wa muvugishwa aca akura ca gitambara mu maso, umwami wa Isirayeli aca aramenya ko ari umwe mu bavugishwa. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Wa muvugishwa aca amubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Warekuye umuntu nari nategetse ko apfa, none rero ubuzima bwawe ni bwo buhasigara, kandi abantu bawe ni bo bapfa mu kibanza c’abantu biwe.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Nuko umwami wa Isirayeli aca asubira ku kirimba ciwe i Samariya ababaye, yijiriwe.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Naboti n’uruzabibu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Kandi ico gihe hariho umuntu yitwa Naboti w’i Yezireyeli, yari afise itongo ry’imizabibu aho nyene i Yezireyeli, hafi y’ikirimba ca Ahabu umwami w’i Samariya. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Ahabu abarira Naboti ati: “Mpa uruzabibu rwawe ndarurimemwo imboga, kuko ruri hafi y’ikirimba canje. Nanje ndaguha urundi ruzabibu rwiza gusumba urwo, canke na ho ushatse ndarukugurire amahera.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Ariko Naboti yishura Ahabu ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntakavyumve ko noguha iragi rya ba sogokuruza.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Ahabu ataha iwe, yijiriwe, ababajwe n’uko Naboti w’i Yezireyeli amubwiye ati: “Sindaguha iragi rya ba sogokuruza.” Aryama ku buriri bwiwe araba ku ruhome, yanka no kurya.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Umugore wiwe Yezebeli yinjira aho aryamye amubaza ati: “Ni kubera iki wijiriwe? Ni iki gitumye utarya?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Aramwishura ati: “Nabwiye Naboti w’i Yezireyeli nti: ‘Ndakugurire uruzabibu rwawe, canke ushatse ndaguhe urundi ruzabibu.’ ” Ariko yambwiye ati: “Sinshobora kuguha uruzabibu rwanje.”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Yezebeli aramubaza ati: “Mbega si wewe uri umwami wa Isirayeli? Vyuka ufungure, ushire umubabaro. Urwo ruzabibu rwa Naboti w’i Yezireyeli jewe nzoruguha.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Nuko aca yandika amakete kw’izina rya Ahabu, ayaterako n’ikidodo ciwe, ayarungikira abatware n’abubahwa bo mu gisagara Naboti yabamwo. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Muri ayo makete yandika ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 21:9">“Nimushinge umusi wo kwisonzesha, hanyuma Naboti abe ari we mushira imbere arongore abandi. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Muce murondera abantu babiri bashirukanya, bagirize Naboti ko yatutse Imana n’umwami. Muce mumusohokana mumwicishe amabuye.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Nuko abatware n’abubahwa bo mu gisagara Naboti yabamwo babikora nk’uko Yezebeli yabibabwiye muri ayo makete yabandikiye. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Bashinga umusi wo kwisonzesha, bashira Naboti imbere y’ikoraniro. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Haca haza abantu babiri bicara aharabana n’aho Naboti yari yicaye, bamwagiriza imbere y’abantu bavuga bati: “Naboti yatutse Imana n’umwami.” Baca baramufata bamusohokana inyuma y’igisagara, bamwicisha amabuye. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Baca barungika intumwa kuri Yezebeli bati: “Naboti yicishijwe amabuye.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Yezebeli yumvise ko Naboti yicishijwe amabuye, aragenda abwira Ahabu ati: “Vyuka uje gushikira rwa ruzabibu rwa Naboti w’i Yezireyeli yari yanse kuguha. Ntakiri muzima, yapfuye.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Ahabu yumvise ko Naboti w’i Yezireyeli yapfuye, aca arahaguruka aja kwigarurira rwa ruzabibu rwiwe.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Ariko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Eliya Umunyetishubi, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />riti: “Manuka urabe Ahabu umwami wa Isirayeli aba i Samariya. Ubu ari mu ruzabibu rwa Naboti urwo yigaruriye. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Umubwire uti: ‘Wishe umuntu none wigaruriye n’utwiwe!’ Wongere umubwire uti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: Ko ukoze ivyo, imbwa zizorigatira amaraso yawe inyuma y’igisagara, aho zarigatiye aya Naboti.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Ahabu aca abwira Eliya ati: “Urandonse akaryo, wa mwansi wanje we!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Eliya amwishura ati: “Ndakuronse akaryo nyene, kuko wiyeguriye gukora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agiye kugusukako ivyago, arandure uruvyaro rwawe, arandure abo mu nzu ya Ahabu gushika ku muhungu wa nyuma muri Isirayeli, yaba umugurano canke uwidegemvya. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Umuryango wawe azowutikiza nk’uwa Yerobowamu mwene Nebati canke uwa Bayasha mwene Ahiya, kuko wamuteye ubushangashirwe, ugakwegera Abisirayeli mu vyaha.<verse eid="1KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Nayo ku vyerekeye Yezebeli, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye ko imbwa zizorira umuvyimba wiwe ku ruzitiro rw’i Yezireyeli.<verse eid="1KI 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Abo mu muryango wawe bazogwa mu gisagara, bazoribwa n’imbwa, abazogwa mu gahinga na bo bazoribwa n’ibisiga vyo mu kirere.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />(Nta muntu n’umwe yari yarihebeye gukora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kunganya Ahabu, abikwegewemwo n’umugore wiwe Yezebeli. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Yakoze ivy’agahomerabunwa vyinshi mu gusenga ibishushanyo nk’uko Abamori babisenga, abo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yirukanye imbere y’Abisirayeli.)<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Ahabu yumvise ayo majambo, yitabagurirako impuzu, yambara amagunira, arisonzesha. Mbere akaryama yambaye igunira, akagenda yipfumbereje.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Eliya Umunyetishubi, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />riti: “Wabonye ingene Ahabu yicishije bugufi imbere yanje? Ko yicishije bugufi, sinzomushitsako ibi vyago mu gihe azoba akiriho. Nzobishitsa ku muryango wiwe mu gihe hazoba hatwara umuhungu wiwe.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Umuvugishwa Mikaya avuga urupfu rwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Abisirayeli n’Abasiriya bamara imyaka itatu ata ntambara ibaye hagati yabo. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Ariko mu mwaka ugira kane, Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda amanuka kuramutsa Ahabu umwami wa Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Umwami wa Isirayeli yari yarabwiye abatware biwe ati: “Mbega ntimuzi ko igisagara ca Ramoti Gileyadi cari icacu? Ko mbona ata co turiko turakora ngo tucake umwami w’i Siriya?”<verse eid="1KI 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Nuko abaza Yehoshafati ati: “Mbega wojana nanje gutera Ramoti Gileyadi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Yehoshafati yishura umwami w’Abisirayeli ati: “Twe nawe turi bamwe, abantu banje ni abawe, n’amafarasi yanje ni ayawe.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Ariko Yehoshafati yongerako abwira umwami w’Abisirayeli ati: “Reka tubanze tugishe inama <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Nuko umwami w’Abisirayeli akoranya abavugishwa; bose hamwe bari abagabo amajana ane. Araheza ababaza ati: “Mbega mubona twoja gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi, canke tureke?” Barishura bati: “Nimugende, kuko Imana izohatanga mu kuboko kwawe mwami.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Ariko Yehoshafati arabaza ati: “Mbega ngaha nta muvugishwa w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umwe akihari twobaza?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Umwami w’Abisirayeli yishura Yehoshafati ati: “Haracariho uwundi muvugishwa umwe yotubariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko ndamwanka kuko atigera avugishwa ivyiza kuri jewe, atari ibibi. Ni Mikaya mwene Imula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Yehoshafati aramwishura ati: “Umwami ntakwiye kuvuga atyo.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Nuko umwami w’Abisirayeli ahamagara umwe mu batware biwe amubwira ati: “Nyaruka uzane Mikaya mwene Imula.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli na Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda, bari bambaye amakanzu yabo y’inyambarabami, bicara ku ntebe z’ubwami ku mbuga yo gusekurirako ingano iri kw’irembo ry’i Samariya, abavugishwa bavugishirizwa imbere yabo. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Maze Zedekiya mwene Kenayana yari yarakoze amahembe y’icuma, aca avuga ati: “Uku ni ko Uhoraho avuze: ‘Aya ni yo uzokwicisha Abasiriya gushika ubaranduye.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Abandi bavugishwa bose na bo nyene bavugishwa ukwo nyene, bati: “Genda utere i Ramoti Gileyadi, uzohatsinda, kuko Uhoraho azohatanga mu maboko y’umwami.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Ya ntumwa yari yagiye guhamagara Mikaya iramubwira iti: “Raba abandi bavugishwa bose bahurije hamwe nk’umuntu umwe mu kuvugishwa intsinzi y’umwami. Ijambo ryawe rero rize guhura n’iryabo, uvuge ivyiza.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Ariko Mikaya amwishura ati: “Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ico Uhoraho ambwira ni co nja kuvuga.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Ashitse, umwami aramubaza ati: “Mikaya, mbega tuje gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi, canke tureke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Aramwishura ati: “Genda uhatere kandi uzotsinda, kuko Uhoraho azohatanga mu maboko yawe mwami.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Umwami aca amubwira ati: “Nzogeza ryari kukurahiza kugira ngo ntihagire ikindi umbwira atari ukuri mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Mikaya amwishura ati: “Mu kwerekwa nabonye Abisirayeli bashwiragiye ku misozi nk’intama zitagira umwungere, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca ambarira ati: ‘Abo bantu ntibagira shebuja. Barungike umwe wese atahe mu rugo rwiwe amahoro.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Umwami w’Abisirayeli abarira Yehoshafati ati: “Sinakubwiye ko atigera avugishwa iciza na kimwe kuri jewe, atari ibibi gusa?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Mikaya arabandanya ati: “Nuko niwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho: Nabonye Uhoraho avyagiye ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami ari kumwe n’ingabo zo mw’ijuru zihagaze i buryo n’i bubamfu bwiwe. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: ‘Ni nde yokwosha Ahabu ngo aje gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi kugira ngo aze yicirweyo?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:20">Umwe akavuga ibi, uwundi ibindi. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Mu nyuma ni ho haza impwemu ihagarara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imubwira iti: ‘Jewe nomwosha!’ <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ayibaza ati: ‘Uzobikora gute?’<verse eid="1KI 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arayibaza ati: ‘Uzobigenza gute?’ Na yo yishura iti: ‘Nzosohoka mbe impwemu yo kubesha mu kanwa k’abavugishwa biwe bose.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ayibwira ati: ‘Ni vyo, uzoshobora kumwosha! Genda ubikore.’<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />None rero, ehe raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yashize impwemu yo kubesha mu kanwa k’abavugishwa bawe bose, kuko yamaze gufata ingingo yo kugusukako ivyago.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Nuko Zedekiya mwene Kenayana ava hasi akubita ikofe Mikaya. Amubaza ati: “Iyo mpwemu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaciye hehe iva kuri jewe iza kuvugana nawe?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya amwishura ati: “Uzobimenya umusi uzobura aho winyegeza, ukajarajara uva mu cumba kimwe uja mu kindi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Umwami w’Abisirayeli atanga itegeko ati: “Nimumufate, mumujane kwa Amoni umukuru w’igisagara no kwa Yowashi umwana w’umwami. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Mubabwire muti: ‘Umwami avuze ngo: Uyu mugabo nimumushire mw’ibohero, ntihagire ikindi mumugaburira atari umukate n’amazi vy’inticantikize, gushika aho nzogarukira amahoro mvuye ku rugamba!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Mikaya na we aca avuga ati: “Niwagaruka amahoro, nzoba ntavugishijwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!” Yongera abwira abari ngaho ati: “Yemwe bantu mwese, muraba muvyumvise!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahabu yicirwa i Ramoti Gileyadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Nuko umwami w’Abisirayeli na Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda, baduga i Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Umwami wa Isirayeli abarira Yehoshafati ati: “Nja kwinjira mu rugamba niyoberanije, ariko wewe ugume wambaye impuzu zawe z’inyambarabami.” Nuko umwami wa Isirayeli ariyoberanya aja ku rugamba.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Umwami w’i Siriya ategeka abarongora abagwanira ku mikogote yiwe mirongo itatu na babiri ati: “Ntihagire uwundi muntu n’umwe mutera, yaba muto canke mukuru, atari umwami w’Abisirayeli.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Ba bakuru b’abagwanira ku mikogote babonye Yehoshafati, baribwira bati: “Nta gukeka, uwu ni we mwami w’Abisirayeli.” Nuko barahindukira ngo bamutere, ariko Yehoshafati arataka, <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />umukuru wabo aca arabona ko atari we mwami wa Isirayeli, ni ko kumuva inyuma bakamureka.<verse eid="1KI 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Ariko umuntu umwe afora umuheto apfa kurasa, aca agema umwami w’Abisirayeli aho ivyuma bimukingira bihurira. Umwami aca abwira uwatwara umukogote wiwe ati: “Hindukira unkure mu rugamba, ndakomeretse.” <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Ariko kuri uwo musi, urugamba rurushiriza gukomera maze umwami bapfa kumushigikirira aho nyene mu mukogote, aguma ameze nk’uwuhanganye n’Abasiriya. Ca gikomere kiva amaraso menshi, atembera mu mukogote, hageze ku mugoroba, aracikana. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Izuba ririko rirarenga, itegeko rikwira mu bari ku rugamba bose, rivuga riti: “Umwe wese nasubire mu gisagara ciwe; umwe wese nasubire i muhira iwe!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Nuko umwami arapfa, bamutahana i Samariya, bamuhambayo. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Wa mukogote bawogereza ku kidengeri c’i Samariya aho ba maraya biyuhagirira, imbwa zirigata amaraso yiwe nk’uko Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryabivuze.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Ahabu, hamwe n’ikirimba gisharijwe n’amahembe y’inzovu yubatse n’ibisagara yubatse, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahabu ahamvya ba sekuruza, umuhungu wiwe Ahaziya aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Yehoshafati mwene Asa yabaye umwami w’i Buyuda mu mwaka ugira kane Ahabu ari umwami wa Isirayeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehoshafati yari afise imyaka mirongo itatu n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aganza imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Azuba, umukobwa wa Shiluhi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Agendera mu nzira za se Asa muri vyose, kandi ntiyakikama ngo azivemwo; akora ibigororotse mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ariko ku ngoma yiwe ntiyashoboye gukuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi; abantu babandanije gushikanirayo ibimazi no gutuririraho ibimota neza. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Kandi Yehoshafati yabanye amahoro n’umwami wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehoshafati, ivy’ubutwari bwiwe, ivyo yakoze n’ivy’intambara yagwanye, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyagenda biraba ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Yirukana mu gihugu ciwe abagabo n’abagore b’abamaraya mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo bari basigaye ku bari bahari mu gihe ca se Asa. <verse eid="1KI 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Ico gihe muri Edomu nta mwami bari bafise, abakuru b’intara ni bo batwara.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Ico gihe Yehoshafati yubakisha amato maninimanini nk’ay’i Tarushishi yo kuja i Ofiru kuzana inzahabu, ariko ntiyigeze ava aho ari kuko yaciye amenekera i Eziyoni Geberi. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Ico gihe kandi, Ahaziya mwene Ahabu yari yabwiye Yehoshafati ati: “Reka abantu banje basozanye n’abawe.” Ariko Yehoshafati aramwankira.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Maze Yehoshafati arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa mu Gisagara ca sekuruza Dawidi, umuhungu wiwe Yehoramu amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Ahaziya umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Ahaziya mwene Ahabu yabaye umwami wa Isirayeli aba i Samariya mu mwaka ugira cumi n’indwi Yehoshafati ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, amara imyaka ibiri ku ngoma. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Akora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko yagendeye mu ngeso za se na nyina, no mu za Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, umwe yakwegera Abisirayeli mu vyaha. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Yakoreye Bayali yongera arayisenga, avyura ishavu ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli, nk’uko se yabigize.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>